(4610854, 663192, 58457, '<td valign="top">This is a really strong entry.  It fits the theme perfectly (no cool colors at all), good composition--I like the tilt, and I like the shallow DOF.</td>', 'This is a really strong entry.  It fits the theme perfectly (no cool colors at all), good composition--I like the tilt, and I like the shallow DOF.', '2008-04-03 13:00:35.000000', NULL, 1),
