(4610857, 664761, 58457, '<td valign="top">A solid abstract, and strong entry for me in the warm colors challenge.  I don''t know how high you''ll score, but I like it!</td>', 'A solid abstract, and strong entry for me in the warm colors challenge.  I don''t know how high you''ll score, but I like it!', '2008-04-03 13:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
