(4610995, 662348, 30049, '<td valign="top">I love the dramatic sky and the "God rays".  Tough one to shoot and in this case the blown highlights take away from this a little.  BTW - You should always use the maximum size allowed whenever possible (640px on the long side for a ''Basic'' challenge).</td>', 'I love the dramatic sky and the "God rays".  Tough one to shoot and in this case the blown highlights take away from this a little.  BTW - You should always use the maximum size allowed whenever possible (640px on the long side for a ''Basic'' challenge).', '2008-04-03 14:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611010, 663069, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of the single blossom.  I was out taking some images the other day very similar.  :-)  The curve of the branch adds a nice gentle restrainer to keep the viewer engaged with the photo.  Focus is a tad soft, which overall is fine, but I think this would be stronger if the details of the blossom were more defined.<br/> <br/>Technically, the pink is a "warm" color.  Somehow, the image feels cold and the pink isn''t strong (or large) enough to raise the temperature IMO.  The large bg area of white/grey is influencing the overall impact I think.<br/> <br/>All JMO of course.  :-)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of the single blossom.  I was out taking some images the other day very similar.  :-)  The curve of the branch adds a nice gentle restrainer to keep the viewer engaged with the photo.  Focus is a tad soft, which overall is fine, but I think this would be stronger if the details of the blossom were more defined. Technically, the pink is a "warm" color.  Somehow, the image feels cold and the pink isn''t strong (or large) enough to raise the temperature IMO.  The large bg area of white/grey is influencing the overall impact I think. All JMO of course.  :-)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-04-03 14:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611022, 664770, 30049, '<td valign="top">Good use of the lighthouse to partially block the sun.  Some optical illusions going on here.  The horizon seems slightly tilted to the left, and the lighthouse appears to have a slight right lean.  I''m pretty sure it all has to do with the various angles in the photo...<br/> <br/>Nice timing for this image to capture the strong reds.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Good use of the lighthouse to partially block the sun.  Some optical illusions going on here.  The horizon seems slightly tilted to the left, and the lighthouse appears to have a slight right lean.  I''m pretty sure it all has to do with the various angles in the photo... Nice timing for this image to capture the strong reds.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-04-03 14:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611023, 665137, 66201, '<td valign="top">Beautiful zen-like quality and great warm, natural tone.</td>', 'Beautiful zen-like quality and great warm, natural tone.', '2008-04-03 14:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611025, 664414, 30049, '<td valign="top">I like the scene.  However, the pink seems just a tad unnatural.<br/> <br/>BTW - Did you know you can legally remove those dust bunnies (sensor spots) for basic editing run challenges?  :-)</td>', 'I like the scene.  However, the pink seems just a tad unnatural. BTW - Did you know you can legally remove those dust bunnies (sensor spots) for basic editing run challenges?  :-)', '2008-04-03 14:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611027, 662799, 30049, '<td valign="top">Who, where, what???  Somebody/something in there?<br/> <br/>I like the concept.  The foreground bokeh seems too strong with that large red block in the upper area.  A little repositioning for another POV may have worked better.  Still using foreground bokeh, but not with such a large blotch.</td>', 'Who, where, what???  Somebody/something in there? I like the concept.  The foreground bokeh seems too strong with that large red block in the upper area.  A little repositioning for another POV may have worked better.  Still using foreground bokeh, but not with such a large blotch.', '2008-04-03 14:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611036, 664780, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice color and good use of flare.  A trick to try with so many bare branches is to use ''Despeckle'' or ''Salt&amp;Pepper'' in your noise reduction choices of the software app you''re using.</td>', 'Nice color and good use of flare.  A trick to try with so many bare branches is to use ''Despeckle'' or ''Salt&Pepper'' in your noise reduction choices of the software app you''re using.', '2008-04-03 14:49:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611037, 664733, 90806, '<td valign="top">perhaps the colored tips could have been in focus</td>', 'perhaps the colored tips could have been in focus', '2008-04-03 14:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611040, 664738, 46214, '<td valign="top">Try focusing on the eyes</td>', 'Try focusing on the eyes', '2008-04-03 14:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611041, 662542, 30049, '<td valign="top">Too much tan!<br/> <br/> <br/>:-)  Sorry.  Couldn''t resist after your post in the forums.  Pretty easy to know which photo is your''s considering there is only one cat photo in this challenge.<br/> <br/>Very cute photo BTW.  Have a couple of these creatures at home myself.  Based on knowing who''s this is, I''m abstaining from voting.  As is, I''d give it a 5 or 6.  Could be sharpened a tad, and maybe a slight contrast boost.<br/> <br/>Good luck.</td>', 'Too much tan!  :-)  Sorry.  Couldn''t resist after your post in the forums.  Pretty easy to know which photo is your''s considering there is only one cat photo in this challenge. Very cute photo BTW.  Have a couple of these creatures at home myself.  Based on knowing who''s this is, I''m abstaining from voting.  As is, I''d give it a 5 or 6.  Could be sharpened a tad, and maybe a slight contrast boost. Good luck.', '2008-04-03 14:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611042, 664687, 90806, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and idea. Perhaps could have benefitted from a different angle to make the fork less of the star or maybe simplified a bit.</td>', 'Nice colors and idea. Perhaps could have benefitted from a different angle to make the fork less of the star or maybe simplified a bit.', '2008-04-03 14:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
