(4611049, 662794, 30049, '<td valign="top">Lots of flowers in this challenge, that''s for sure.  :-)<br/> <br/>This photo could use some levels adjustments, maybe a shot of contrast, and some sharpening plus noise reduction.<br/> <br/>Trying to figure out what''s going on at the bottom edge.  There seems to be something opaque running across where the leaves are.<br/> <br/>Anyway...good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Lots of flowers in this challenge, that''s for sure.  :-) This photo could use some levels adjustments, maybe a shot of contrast, and some sharpening plus noise reduction. Trying to figure out what''s going on at the bottom edge.  There seems to be something opaque running across where the leaves are. Anyway...good luck in the challenge.', '2008-04-03 14:56:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611054, 664933, 90806, '<td valign="top">Interestingly minimal color in a color challenge.</td>', 'Interestingly minimal color in a color challenge.', '2008-04-03 14:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
