(4611062, 664431, 30049, '<td valign="top">The tree gets lost in this.  I wouldn''t have seen it except for the title and some looking.  Lighting is quite harsh...maybe another time of day (early or late) would be better suited to shoot this location?<br/> <br/>I see two faces in the cliff shadows (the lower part).  The actual rock face looks like a monkey/gorilla, then where the shadow falls on the left side of the outcrop there is a human profile formed by the shadow.  :-D</td>', 'The tree gets lost in this.  I wouldn''t have seen it except for the title and some looking.  Lighting is quite harsh...maybe another time of day (early or late) would be better suited to shoot this location? I see two faces in the cliff shadows (the lower part).  The actual rock face looks like a monkey/gorilla, then where the shadow falls on the left side of the outcrop there is a human profile formed by the shadow.  :-D', '2008-04-03 15:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
