(4611079, 665108, 30049, '<td valign="top">Cute dog.  :-)  The use of flash is creating some distracting shadows and also casting a slightly cooling effect (very slight) to the color.  In one way the flash worked in your favor by illuminating the foreground and letting the bg fade out.  Glad you didn''t use a black border...that would have made the image feel much darker.<br/> <br/>All JMO of course.  :-)  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Cute dog.  :-)  The use of flash is creating some distracting shadows and also casting a slightly cooling effect (very slight) to the color.  In one way the flash worked in your favor by illuminating the foreground and letting the bg fade out.  Glad you didn''t use a black border...that would have made the image feel much darker. All JMO of course.  :-)  Good luck in the challenge.', '2008-04-03 15:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
