(4611185, 665079, 92186, '<td valign="top">The clipping looks like it was kind of sloppy.  If the white blotches are supposed to be there, then I apologize.  But it doesn''t look clean.</td>', 'The clipping looks like it was kind of sloppy.  If the white blotches are supposed to be there, then I apologize.  But it doesn''t look clean.', '2008-04-03 15:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611186, 664238, 92186, '<td valign="top">Nice.  Simple.  Clean.</td>', 'Nice.  Simple.  Clean.', '2008-04-03 15:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611190, 664267, 90806, '<td valign="top">Cool blue shadow.  Not primarily warm colors.</td>', 'Cool blue shadow.  Not primarily warm colors.', '2008-04-03 15:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611191, 665004, 92186, '<td valign="top">Excellent perspective.  Great to shoot along the tops of the flowers.</td>', 'Excellent perspective.  Great to shoot along the tops of the flowers.', '2008-04-03 15:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611193, 664854, 90806, '<td valign="top">Odd white flecks and dof to me.</td>', 'Odd white flecks and dof to me.', '2008-04-03 15:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611194, 665076, 92186, '<td valign="top">I like the idea.  I''d prefer to see her face in focus and her arm blurred, rather than the other way around.</td>', 'I like the idea.  I''d prefer to see her face in focus and her arm blurred, rather than the other way around.', '2008-04-03 15:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611198, 664107, 90806, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a tighter framing to make the warm colors fill more of the frame might have helped.</td>', 'Perhaps a tighter framing to make the warm colors fill more of the frame might have helped.', '2008-04-03 15:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611201, 663952, 90806, '<td valign="top">Perhaps oversharpened to my taste.</td>', 'Perhaps oversharpened to my taste.', '2008-04-03 15:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611204, 664761, 90806, '<td valign="top">nice colors and pattern framed at an interesting angle.</td>', 'nice colors and pattern framed at an interesting angle.', '2008-04-03 15:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611224, 662549, 90806, '<td valign="top">Looks yummy</td>', 'Looks yummy', '2008-04-03 15:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611387, 664831, 92186, '<td valign="top">Beautiful work - great clarity, and I love the water drops, especially the one falling off.  Excellent!</td>', 'Beautiful work - great clarity, and I love the water drops, especially the one falling off.  Excellent!', '2008-04-03 16:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611390, 665003, 92186, '<td valign="top">It''s too bad the little bits of green get in the way.  The shot of the - umm - crocodile? alligator? - is great!</td>', 'It''s too bad the little bits of green get in the way.  The shot of the - umm - crocodile? alligator? - is great!', '2008-04-03 16:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611393, 665055, 92186, '<td valign="top">I really like the way the closest trees are black silhouettes, while the ones going off into the distance are color-shifting.  The whole composition is <i>exceptional</i>.</td>', 'I really like the way the closest trees are black silhouettes, while the ones going off into the distance are color-shifting.  The whole composition is exceptional.', '2008-04-03 16:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611419, 664955, 86799, '<td valign="top">Nice.  The DOF is just right.  Maybe bring the overall brightness up just a little.</td>', 'Nice.  The DOF is just right.  Maybe bring the overall brightness up just a little.', '2008-04-03 16:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611421, 664947, 86799, '<td valign="top">Needs some contrast and saturation to bring up the interest...would be better with some "punch".</td>', 'Needs some contrast and saturation to bring up the interest...would be better with some "punch".', '2008-04-03 16:52:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611422, 664666, 86799, '<td valign="top">Pretty dark and flat, deadened detail.</td>', 'Pretty dark and flat, deadened detail.', '2008-04-03 16:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611427, 664519, 86799, '<td valign="top">Needs some interest.  A little vague and dull, unsharp.</td>', 'Needs some interest.  A little vague and dull, unsharp.', '2008-04-03 16:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611434, 664360, 86799, '<td valign="top">OOF a little...or the focus is on the person, which throws the foreground out.  Fuzzy flowers distract from an otherwise cool idea.</td>', 'OOF a little...or the focus is on the person, which throws the foreground out.  Fuzzy flowers distract from an otherwise cool idea.', '2008-04-03 16:57:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611436, 664400, 86799, '<td valign="top">You got that right!  Cool idea.</td>', 'You got that right!  Cool idea.', '2008-04-03 16:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611444, 664927, 86799, '<td valign="top">This would be cool if it was in focus.  Blood oranges look exotic and taste great...but they need to be in sharp focus.</td>', 'This would be cool if it was in focus.  Blood oranges look exotic and taste great...but they need to be in sharp focus.', '2008-04-03 17:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611450, 663307, 86799, '<td valign="top">A little washed-out.  There is detail in the petals that would help.</td>', 'A little washed-out.  There is detail in the petals that would help.', '2008-04-03 17:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611460, 663996, 46214, '<td valign="top">I really like this but i''ve seen a lot of flowers with water on them in this challenge. The warm colors in this flower doesn''t need the water.</td>', 'I really like this but i''ve seen a lot of flowers with water on them in this challenge. The warm colors in this flower doesn''t need the water.', '2008-04-03 17:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611494, 664708, 92186, '<td valign="top">This is stunning.  What a wonderful composition.</td>', 'This is stunning.  What a wonderful composition.', '2008-04-03 17:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611495, 663428, 92186, '<td valign="top">This almost looks like a wood block print in the bottom part.  Lovely colors and composition.</td>', 'This almost looks like a wood block print in the bottom part.  Lovely colors and composition.', '2008-04-03 17:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611498, 664975, 28029, '<td valign="top">Could have been great but- blowouts and apparent over-sharpening 7</td>', 'Could have been great but- blowouts and apparent over-sharpening 7', '2008-04-03 17:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611504, 663425, 28029, '<td valign="top">Very Nice</td>', 'Very Nice', '2008-04-03 17:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611506, 663687, 92186, '<td valign="top">How could anyone <i>not</i> love a baby!  And this one is <i>particularly</i> cute.</td>', 'How could anyone not love a baby!  And this one is particularly cute.', '2008-04-03 17:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611521, 662791, 26001, '<td valign="top">you have captured the delicacy of the flower really well. very nice lighting too. 7</td>', 'you have captured the delicacy of the flower really well. very nice lighting too. 7', '2008-04-03 17:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611526, 664848, 26001, '<td valign="top">very nice concept but execution wise a bit more dof (to get complete pencils in focus) could have helped. also multiple light sources could have avoided the harsh shadow too. 6 for the concept and effort</td>', 'very nice concept but execution wise a bit more dof (to get complete pencils in focus) could have helped. also multiple light sources could have avoided the harsh shadow too. 6 for the concept and effort', '2008-04-03 17:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611617, 663971, 24550, '<td valign="top">great sharp image, love the colors and the flame (big fan of fire photography).<br/>the only criticism from me is that the slight curvature and imperfection of the surface supporting the glass distracts my eye and reduces the impact of the shot.</td>', 'great sharp image, love the colors and the flame (big fan of fire photography).the only criticism from me is that the slight curvature and imperfection of the surface supporting the glass distracts my eye and reduces the impact of the shot.', '2008-04-03 18:25:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611618, 664917, 24550, '<td valign="top">looks out of focus and poorly exposed.</td>', 'looks out of focus and poorly exposed.', '2008-04-03 18:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611623, 664682, 24550, '<td valign="top">the glare is too harsh and the focus seems indecisive.</td>', 'the glare is too harsh and the focus seems indecisive.', '2008-04-03 18:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611625, 665136, 24550, '<td valign="top">good abstract, since i can''t really tell what it is. the colors and curves make it interesting to look at.</td>', 'good abstract, since i can''t really tell what it is. the colors and curves make it interesting to look at.', '2008-04-03 18:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611627, 665090, 24550, '<td valign="top">the range of colors is interesting to look at, but the composition doesn''t add much.</td>', 'the range of colors is interesting to look at, but the composition doesn''t add much.', '2008-04-03 18:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611628, 664739, 24550, '<td valign="top">sorry, but i dont think this counts as warm colors. its giving me a pretty distinctive "cool" feel...</td>', 'sorry, but i dont think this counts as warm colors. its giving me a pretty distinctive "cool" feel...', '2008-04-03 18:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611632, 664414, 24550, '<td valign="top">focus on the top of the lighthouse would have worked better. seems to be indecisive focus as it is. also, there are some dust spots (i realize its basic, but just figured i''d point them out)</td>', 'focus on the top of the lighthouse would have worked better. seems to be indecisive focus as it is. also, there are some dust spots (i realize its basic, but just figured i''d point them out)', '2008-04-03 18:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611638, 664666, 24550, '<td valign="top">not sure what kind of camera you''re using, but i think more light would help in reducing the noise of the image. focus also seems to be off. if it was me, i''d aim for the center of the right flower for focus.</td>', 'not sure what kind of camera you''re using, but i think more light would help in reducing the noise of the image. focus also seems to be off. if it was me, i''d aim for the center of the right flower for focus.', '2008-04-03 18:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611644, 664893, 24550, '<td valign="top">i know what you''re going for here, but the image is way too busy, and doesn''t provide the serene effect shots of sunsets usually do.</td>', 'i know what you''re going for here, but the image is way too busy, and doesn''t provide the serene effect shots of sunsets usually do.', '2008-04-03 18:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611646, 664991, 24550, '<td valign="top">nicely done, too bad the petal on the left is browning</td>', 'nicely done, too bad the petal on the left is browning', '2008-04-03 18:35:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611658, 664239, 24550, '<td valign="top">i like the abstractness of this image, and hard as it is to shoot fire, there isn''t a point for my eye to focus on and as such i have a hard time enjoying this shot. great colors.</td>', 'i like the abstractness of this image, and hard as it is to shoot fire, there isn''t a point for my eye to focus on and as such i have a hard time enjoying this shot. great colors.', '2008-04-03 18:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611663, 663195, 24550, '<td valign="top">the dead space up top doesn''t add to this photo, IMO. a closer crop towards the bottom would have worked better. trees are distracting too.</td>', 'the dead space up top doesn''t add to this photo, IMO. a closer crop towards the bottom would have worked better. trees are distracting too.', '2008-04-03 18:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611664, 664933, 24550, '<td valign="top">the lighting is harsh and the shot itself isn''t very interesting to me.</td>', 'the lighting is harsh and the shot itself isn''t very interesting to me.', '2008-04-03 18:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611665, 664423, 24550, '<td valign="top">this is a good shot, but i think you missed with the angle of the lighting. the "stems" coming from the center of the flower on the right are casting a shadow on the petals which ruins the "perfection" of the flower and makes the picture look staged, so to speak. i think a slightly different lighting angle would be very helpful.</td>', 'this is a good shot, but i think you missed with the angle of the lighting. the "stems" coming from the center of the flower on the right are casting a shadow on the petals which ruins the "perfection" of the flower and makes the picture look staged, so to speak. i think a slightly different lighting angle would be very helpful.', '2008-04-03 18:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611667, 662467, 24550, '<td valign="top">i find this photo harsh because of the almost-blown colors on the left side.</td>', 'i find this photo harsh because of the almost-blown colors on the left side.', '2008-04-03 18:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611668, 662568, 24550, '<td valign="top">pretty good, but don''t like the top layer of clouds.</td>', 'pretty good, but don''t like the top layer of clouds.', '2008-04-03 18:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611671, 664146, 24550, '<td valign="top">feels harsh, and the lighting is uninteresting, giving it a snapshot-like feel.</td>', 'feels harsh, and the lighting is uninteresting, giving it a snapshot-like feel.', '2008-04-03 18:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611672, 663331, 24550, '<td valign="top">i think you were going for the water drop with your focus, but i think you missed. if it was me, i''d focus on the right-most flower and use a high-ish f/stop.</td>', 'i think you were going for the water drop with your focus, but i think you missed. if it was me, i''d focus on the right-most flower and use a high-ish f/stop.', '2008-04-03 18:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611673, 665137, 24550, '<td valign="top">a dramatically off-centered composition is the best way to deal with these minimalistic shots. composed this way it just seems empty. a 90 degree rotation clockwise also would help i think.</td>', 'a dramatically off-centered composition is the best way to deal with these minimalistic shots. composed this way it just seems empty. a 90 degree rotation clockwise also would help i think.', '2008-04-03 18:46:46.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4611674, 664519, 24550, '<td valign="top">the image is fairly noisy which leads me to believe there wasn''t enough light to focus properly. i think the right place to focus would have been the water droplets on the glass, not the wood underneath it.</td>', 'the image is fairly noisy which leads me to believe there wasn''t enough light to focus properly. i think the right place to focus would have been the water droplets on the glass, not the wood underneath it.', '2008-04-03 18:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611675, 665111, 24550, '<td valign="top">the fire cut off on the left detracts from this image.</td>', 'the fire cut off on the left detracts from this image.', '2008-04-03 18:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611678, 664816, 24550, '<td valign="top">good shot, but lacks "pop" i think a bit of sharpening would go a long way.</td>', 'good shot, but lacks "pop" i think a bit of sharpening would go a long way.', '2008-04-03 18:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611681, 664780, 24550, '<td valign="top">lovely crisp image with a good range of warm colors. i think if you waited a few more minutes, it would have helped with the lens flare (unless you wanted that effect intentionally)</td>', 'lovely crisp image with a good range of warm colors. i think if you waited a few more minutes, it would have helped with the lens flare (unless you wanted that effect intentionally)', '2008-04-03 18:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611682, 665106, 24550, '<td valign="top">very cool. love seeing pictures and videos of lava.</td>', 'very cool. love seeing pictures and videos of lava.', '2008-04-03 18:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611684, 663989, 24550, '<td valign="top">more tree, please. just the cut-off top of it ruins the effect. <br/>the rightmost tree is distracting in the corner.</td>', 'more tree, please. just the cut-off top of it ruins the effect. the rightmost tree is distracting in the corner.', '2008-04-03 18:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611685, 664948, 24550, '<td valign="top">spot on focus, good use of soft-blur</td>', 'spot on focus, good use of soft-blur', '2008-04-03 18:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611686, 664784, 24550, '<td valign="top">lovely curves.</td>', 'lovely curves.', '2008-04-03 18:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611687, 662799, 24550, '<td valign="top">experimental, but i like it.</td>', 'experimental, but i like it.', '2008-04-03 18:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611688, 662807, 24550, '<td valign="top">sorry but this just isn''t interesting. i dont think you''ve added anything to the composition. its just a picture of a sticker/sign.</td>', 'sorry but this just isn''t interesting. i dont think you''ve added anything to the composition. its just a picture of a sticker/sign.', '2008-04-03 18:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611689, 662898, 24550, '<td valign="top">the tilt makes the shot interesting, since my eye expects the flame to go up.</td>', 'the tilt makes the shot interesting, since my eye expects the flame to go up.', '2008-04-03 18:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611695, 663996, 24550, '<td valign="top">fantastic crisp shot. this must be a top 5 for the challenge.</td>', 'fantastic crisp shot. this must be a top 5 for the challenge.', '2008-04-03 18:54:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611697, 664753, 24550, '<td valign="top">great image.</td>', 'great image.', '2008-04-03 18:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611698, 663094, 24550, '<td valign="top">makkah? beautiful.</td>', 'makkah? beautiful.', '2008-04-03 18:54:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611699, 665055, 24550, '<td valign="top">great range of tones on this image, progressing towards the right. would make a good print.</td>', 'great range of tones on this image, progressing towards the right. would make a good print.', '2008-04-03 18:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611715, 662807, 90777, '<td valign="top">Please tell me the typo in your submission is deliberate?</td>', 'Please tell me the typo in your submission is deliberate?', '2008-04-03 19:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611717, 664991, 90777, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, however, there is a small black spot on the big petal near the centre.  Not marking down though cos its only basic editing.</td>', 'Beautiful, however, there is a small black spot on the big petal near the centre.  Not marking down though cos its only basic editing.', '2008-04-03 19:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611718, 664949, 90777, '<td valign="top">A good concept, however, i feel it may have been better without the hand</td>', 'A good concept, however, i feel it may have been better without the hand', '2008-04-03 19:07:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611720, 662937, 90777, '<td valign="top">A good idea, however it looks like the bottle base is focussed better than the label</td>', 'A good idea, however it looks like the bottle base is focussed better than the label', '2008-04-03 19:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611724, 664653, 90777, '<td valign="top">The late day sunlight(?) adds warmth to your image.  <br/>Hope you don''t get nailed by the spelling police!</td>', 'The late day sunlight(?) adds warmth to your image.  Hope you don''t get nailed by the spelling police!', '2008-04-03 19:10:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611725, 664799, 90777, '<td valign="top">Could it be any warmer?</td>', 'Could it be any warmer?', '2008-04-03 19:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4611729, 665041, 90777, '<td valign="top">Good composition and use of negative space.</td>', 'Good composition and use of negative space.', '2008-04-03 19:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
