(4611836, 664267, 90777, '<td valign="top">A well exposed, well composed portrait of a street entertainer, however, The challenge was to create a photograph comprised primarily of warm colurs (red yellow orange)  there are too many colours in here to meet this particular challenge, especially the large blue balloon and his hat.  Also your frame adds nothing to the final product. Sorry.</td>', 'A well exposed, well composed portrait of a street entertainer, however, The challenge was to create a photograph comprised primarily of warm colurs (red yellow orange)  there are too many colours in here to meet this particular challenge, especially the large blue balloon and his hat.  Also your frame adds nothing to the final product. Sorry.', '2008-04-03 19:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
