(4612302, 663985, 19799, '<td valign="top">A tighter crop would help. The rock or surface the lizard is on seems to be dead space in the photo. I also think using natural light or diffusing the flash would help the photo.</td>', 'A tighter crop would help. The rock or surface the lizard is on seems to be dead space in the photo. I also think using natural light or diffusing the flash would help the photo.', '2008-04-03 23:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
