(4612313, 663989, 19799, '<td valign="top">Would like to have seen more of the land in this photo. The white clouds in the upper right corner definitely don''t add anything positive to the shot. I like the silhouette, cloud cover, and colour of the sky though.</td>', 'Would like to have seen more of the land in this photo. The white clouds in the upper right corner definitely don''t add anything positive to the shot. I like the silhouette, cloud cover, and colour of the sky though.', '2008-04-03 23:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
