(4612316, 665141, 19799, '<td valign="top">This shot definitely follows the theme of this challenge well. Good capture.</td>', 'This shot definitely follows the theme of this challenge well. Good capture.', '2008-04-03 23:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4612319, 664425, 19799, '<td valign="top">The one thing I notice is the main subject in this shot is too centered. I think either a tighter crop or moving it off center would help the aesthetics of the shot. It also looks a bit underexposed.</td>', 'The one thing I notice is the main subject in this shot is too centered. I think either a tighter crop or moving it off center would help the aesthetics of the shot. It also looks a bit underexposed.', '2008-04-03 23:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4612323, 663151, 19799, '<td valign="top">I think if you would have metered off the dogs rump it would have had a more pleasing tone. There are too many blown out areas. Also, if you could have changed your perspective by walking to your left a bit to get the corner of the pillow removed from the shot would have helped too.</td>', 'I think if you would have metered off the dogs rump it would have had a more pleasing tone. There are too many blown out areas. Also, if you could have changed your perspective by walking to your left a bit to get the corner of the pillow removed from the shot would have helped too.', '2008-04-04 00:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4612330, 664985, 19799, '<td valign="top">The one comment I have is maybe going down to eye level or getting higher to take the shot. This is a classic snapshot of the camera person standing with camera raised and no forethought on perspective. Very good exposure and sharpness, as well as using the warm colour theme of the challenge.</td>', 'The one comment I have is maybe going down to eye level or getting higher to take the shot. This is a classic snapshot of the camera person standing with camera raised and no forethought on perspective. Very good exposure and sharpness, as well as using the warm colour theme of the challenge.', '2008-04-04 00:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4612336, 662937, 19799, '<td valign="top">I think closing down the aperture would have made this shot better by having more of the scene in focus or slowing down the shutter speed to give the water that wispy cloud like look.</td>', 'I think closing down the aperture would have made this shot better by having more of the scene in focus or slowing down the shutter speed to give the water that wispy cloud like look.', '2008-04-04 00:06:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4612341, 664854, 19799, '<td valign="top">The only comment I have is the shot is too centered. I think if its going to be centered then a tighter crop to eliminate the dead spaces on the sides and top.</td>', 'The only comment I have is the shot is too centered. I think if its going to be centered then a tighter crop to eliminate the dead spaces on the sides and top.', '2008-04-04 00:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4612345, 664586, 19799, '<td valign="top">Good capture. My only comment is trying a different crop where by there is space in front of the boat (boat is on the far left of the picture instead of the far right).</td>', 'Good capture. My only comment is trying a different crop where by there is space in front of the boat (boat is on the far left of the picture instead of the far right).', '2008-04-04 00:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
