(4613245, 663051, 87808, '<td valign="top">This is an amazing flower, love the curls that appear on this.  The bee is nice and black with a good contrast. The hot pink against the cool green works in your favour.<br/> <br/>I would say almost that the flower is overwhelming your main subject, if you shape your left land into a L and crop the picture right up to the more whitish of the plant, you have a more dramatic main subject. <br/> <br/>Your lines are clean and sharp, the colours are outstanding, you have managed to get a nice sharpness about all the aspects but no halos from over sharpneing, very nicely done.  The title does help to determine that it is a bee, I first thought it was a fly.  Doesnt matter either way, bee/fly works well.<br/> <br/>You did a great job on this macro. 8</td>', 'This is an amazing flower, love the curls that appear on this.  The bee is nice and black with a good contrast. The hot pink against the cool green works in your favour. I would say almost that the flower is overwhelming your main subject, if you shape your left land into a L and crop the picture right up to the more whitish of the plant, you have a more dramatic main subject.  Your lines are clean and sharp, the colours are outstanding, you have managed to get a nice sharpness about all the aspects but no halos from over sharpneing, very nicely done.  The title does help to determine that it is a bee, I first thought it was a fly.  Doesnt matter either way, bee/fly works well. You did a great job on this macro. 8', '2008-04-04 10:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613493, 664991, 58457, '<td valign="top">Nice close up of the flower, and I do get the softness of the petals.  Good job on filling the frame with "pinkness"</td>', 'Nice close up of the flower, and I do get the softness of the petals.  Good job on filling the frame with "pinkness"', '2008-04-04 11:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613499, 662293, 58457, '<td valign="top">I like the color you achieved in this phoot and the silhoette of teh boater.  I''m wondering if a bit of shore line was included in the bottom of the fram if it would have been stronger. 7.</td>', 'I like the color you achieved in this phoot and the silhoette of teh boater.  I''m wondering if a bit of shore line was included in the bottom of the fram if it would have been stronger. 7.', '2008-04-04 11:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613500, 664715, 58457, '<td valign="top">Nice close up of the inside of a tulip.  And good DOF.</td>', 'Nice close up of the inside of a tulip.  And good DOF.', '2008-04-04 11:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613511, 664500, 58457, '<td valign="top">Solid detail on the petals, I like the soft focus background and the way the light comes through the flower.  I''m curious of your set up or if this was outdoors.</td>', 'Solid detail on the petals, I like the soft focus background and the way the light comes through the flower.  I''m curious of your set up or if this was outdoors.', '2008-04-04 11:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613513, 663046, 58457, '<td valign="top">Nice macro detail of the bee and flower and I do get the "warm" theme through all of the yellow.</td>', 'Nice macro detail of the bee and flower and I do get the "warm" theme through all of the yellow.', '2008-04-04 11:38:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613518, 663414, 58457, '<td valign="top">Great detail on the legs of the fly and the stem he is perched on.  Is this rotated at all?</td>', 'Great detail on the legs of the fly and the stem he is perched on.  Is this rotated at all?', '2008-04-04 11:39:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613520, 663087, 58457, '<td valign="top">That is a rediculous close up!  Ultimately, against others in this challenge it comes off a bit dark, especially in the top of the frame--but its a shot I couldn''t pull off (yet)!</td>', 'That is a rediculous close up!  Ultimately, against others in this challenge it comes off a bit dark, especially in the top of the frame--but its a shot I couldn''t pull off (yet)!', '2008-04-04 11:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613525, 665141, 58457, '<td valign="top">Very solid still life of calalillies. I really get the softness of the pedals out of this-they almost look sculpted.  Sometimes I wonder why flower shops don''t feature better photos (I specifically didn''t choose a shop based on their terrible photos in their flower portfolios).</td>', 'Very solid still life of calalillies. I really get the softness of the pedals out of this-they almost look sculpted.  Sometimes I wonder why flower shops don''t feature better photos (I specifically didn''t choose a shop based on their terrible photos in their flower portfolios).', '2008-04-04 11:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613527, 663971, 58457, '<td valign="top">Nice work on this. The flame isn''t blown out at all--very evenly and well exposed shot.  I could see this in an ad or as decor in a bar.</td>', 'Nice work on this. The flame isn''t blown out at all--very evenly and well exposed shot.  I could see this in an ad or as decor in a bar.', '2008-04-04 11:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613529, 663231, 58457, '<td valign="top">I think normally this may be an average shot, but I really liked it in this challenge of finding a warm themed environment and then catching a kid w/ a red shirt, so I think it has better appeal. 7.</td>', 'I think normally this may be an average shot, but I really liked it in this challenge of finding a warm themed environment and then catching a kid w/ a red shirt, so I think it has better appeal. 7.', '2008-04-04 11:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613532, 662791, 58457, '<td valign="top">Nice soft flower shot.  Definitely has mass appeal for commercial use--I could see this as decor in a nice trendy loft.</td>', 'Nice soft flower shot.  Definitely has mass appeal for commercial use--I could see this as decor in a nice trendy loft.', '2008-04-04 11:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613533, 664848, 58457, '<td valign="top">I''d love to see your setup for how you blurred the background.  I tried something similar w/ colored bencils, and I wasn''t either as well focused as you, or you have a macro lens.  I''d be happy if you didn''t, because that means I can do something similar!<br/>If you were to print this, I''d clone out that tiny yellow spot under the orange pencil.<br/> <br/>Good job on the theme and composition, although I just noticed you''ll probably get DQ''d because of your border.  A shame!</td>', 'I''d love to see your setup for how you blurred the background.  I tried something similar w/ colored bencils, and I wasn''t either as well focused as you, or you have a macro lens.  I''d be happy if you didn''t, because that means I can do something similar!If you were to print this, I''d clone out that tiny yellow spot under the orange pencil. Good job on the theme and composition, although I just noticed you''ll probably get DQ''d because of your border.  A shame!', '2008-04-04 11:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613537, 663763, 58457, '<td valign="top">This fits the theme as well as any other in this challenge.  The candles are well arranged (although if I were nitpicking a few are unevenly spaced.  I like that the wicks are also part of the pattern.</td>', 'This fits the theme as well as any other in this challenge.  The candles are well arranged (although if I were nitpicking a few are unevenly spaced.  I like that the wicks are also part of the pattern.', '2008-04-04 11:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613540, 662898, 58457, '<td valign="top">I think you did a good job achieving sharpness and detail on the lighter while still getting the background exposed well.  I like the rotation of this as well.</td>', 'I think you did a good job achieving sharpness and detail on the lighter while still getting the background exposed well.  I like the rotation of this as well.', '2008-04-04 11:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613544, 664238, 58457, '<td valign="top">I like the streak of red in your background or where the pepper is resting.  I think you may get burned in voting a bit by the highlight on the pepper--its a bit harsh.  But the stem is great and so is the orange color.</td>', 'I like the streak of red in your background or where the pepper is resting.  I think you may get burned in voting a bit by the highlight on the pepper--its a bit harsh.  But the stem is great and so is the orange color.', '2008-04-04 11:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613547, 664708, 58457, '<td valign="top">Interesting radial symmetry created by your point of view.  I tried adding water droplets to my shot in this challenge as well, and I''m wondering if they help your photo, or hurt it (mine as well).  I think maybe a bit too many drops--especially in the center.  Maybe fewer and just on the petals.</td>', 'Interesting radial symmetry created by your point of view.  I tried adding water droplets to my shot in this challenge as well, and I''m wondering if they help your photo, or hurt it (mine as well).  I think maybe a bit too many drops--especially in the center.  Maybe fewer and just on the petals.', '2008-04-04 11:49:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613551, 664518, 58457, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if you rotated this or not, and if it really helped your composition.  To me its a bit funky.  I think the shot of the flower itself is good and the droplets are crystal clear, though.</td>', 'I''m not sure if you rotated this or not, and if it really helped your composition.  To me its a bit funky.  I think the shot of the flower itself is good and the droplets are crystal clear, though.', '2008-04-04 11:50:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613555, 664529, 58457, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot.  I''m wondering if a bit more light would''ve given a touch more definition to the flowers that you are focused on.  However, the blending of the oranges does well for the warm challenge.  I guess I just gave you two conflicting opinions!  Oh well!</td>', 'This is a nice shot.  I''m wondering if a bit more light would''ve given a touch more definition to the flowers that you are focused on.  However, the blending of the oranges does well for the warm challenge.  I guess I just gave you two conflicting opinions!  Oh well!', '2008-04-04 11:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613559, 663956, 58457, '<td valign="top">Nice angle, point of view and sharpness.  However, I just don''t get a whole lot of "warmness" from this photograph despite the fact that she is wearing yellow.  6.</td>', 'Nice angle, point of view and sharpness.  However, I just don''t get a whole lot of "warmness" from this photograph despite the fact that she is wearing yellow.  6.', '2008-04-04 11:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613561, 663428, 58457, '<td valign="top">Solid sunrise photo, and good capture of warm tones.</td>', 'Solid sunrise photo, and good capture of warm tones.', '2008-04-04 11:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613562, 664955, 58457, '<td valign="top">Nice definition of the yarn across whatever that thingy is.</td>', 'Nice definition of the yarn across whatever that thingy is.', '2008-04-04 11:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613566, 663401, 58457, '<td valign="top">Interesting point of vies in this.  If I were printing this, I think I''d clone out the power line and pole in the reflection to make it seem like the hummer is really out in nature.</td>', 'Interesting point of vies in this.  If I were printing this, I think I''d clone out the power line and pole in the reflection to make it seem like the hummer is really out in nature.', '2008-04-04 11:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613567, 664948, 58457, '<td valign="top">Very nice portrait.  Great focus and sharpness on the eyes and the flowers in her hair.</td>', 'Very nice portrait.  Great focus and sharpness on the eyes and the flowers in her hair.', '2008-04-04 11:56:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613569, 665004, 58457, '<td valign="top">good point of view by getting low in this photo.  It may be a bit contrasty, and I don''t know if thats because of time of day or what...  i think I''d like it a bit more if it was a bit softer.</td>', 'good point of view by getting low in this photo.  It may be a bit contrasty, and I don''t know if thats because of time of day or what...  i think I''d like it a bit more if it was a bit softer.', '2008-04-04 11:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613570, 664423, 58457, '<td valign="top">Nice close up of the flowers.  I think your shot may have been stronger w/ a lighter background.</td>', 'Nice close up of the flowers.  I think your shot may have been stronger w/ a lighter background.', '2008-04-04 11:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613575, 662545, 58457, '<td valign="top">This is a really funky sky and interesting point of view.  I gave a 6 for uniqueness, but not higher as it doesn''t fit the theme as well as others in this challenge.</td>', 'This is a really funky sky and interesting point of view.  I gave a 6 for uniqueness, but not higher as it doesn''t fit the theme as well as others in this challenge.', '2008-04-04 11:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613576, 664806, 58457, '<td valign="top">a simple shot and interesting detail on the thingy in the foreground.  I think the leaves provided a good setting.</td>', 'a simple shot and interesting detail on the thingy in the foreground.  I think the leaves provided a good setting.', '2008-04-04 11:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613581, 664027, 58457, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of this shot, and the paint can works well w/ the background.  I think I''d like to see this with different points of view or angles to decide if there could maybe be a stronger overall composition. 6.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of this shot, and the paint can works well w/ the background.  I think I''d like to see this with different points of view or angles to decide if there could maybe be a stronger overall composition. 6.', '2008-04-04 12:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613583, 664854, 58457, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but unfortunately I think some of your water droplets just look like white specs.</td>', 'Nice shot, but unfortunately I think some of your water droplets just look like white specs.', '2008-04-04 12:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613585, 664857, 58457, '<td valign="top">Good sharpness on the feather and the background.  Definitely fits the theme with subtle warm colors. 6.</td>', 'Good sharpness on the feather and the background.  Definitely fits the theme with subtle warm colors. 6.', '2008-04-04 12:03:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613587, 662799, 58457, '<td valign="top">I gave this a 6.  Maybe I''d score it lower, but I like the attempt at a unique perspective here.</td>', 'I gave this a 6.  Maybe I''d score it lower, but I like the attempt at a unique perspective here.', '2008-04-04 12:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613591, 663945, 58457, '<td valign="top">Solid silhouette going on here.  Reminds me of the pier in San Diego.</td>', 'Solid silhouette going on here.  Reminds me of the pier in San Diego.', '2008-04-04 12:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613594, 663540, 58457, '<td valign="top">Good interesting close up.  I think the center of the flower weighs a bit too heavy, I think I''d like to see more of the petals.</td>', 'Good interesting close up.  I think the center of the flower weighs a bit too heavy, I think I''d like to see more of the petals.', '2008-04-04 12:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613596, 664753, 58457, '<td valign="top">Nice, colorful close up here. Works well against the white background.</td>', 'Nice, colorful close up here. Works well against the white background.', '2008-04-04 12:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613599, 663986, 58457, '<td valign="top">I like that this is a uniquely shaped lamp and an interesting composition w/ the angle and the color of the background.  I think you may get docked a bit by the bright white highlight in the lamp which I have no idea how you would avoid.</td>', 'I like that this is a uniquely shaped lamp and an interesting composition w/ the angle and the color of the background.  I think you may get docked a bit by the bright white highlight in the lamp which I have no idea how you would avoid.', '2008-04-04 12:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613601, 664368, 58457, '<td valign="top">Nice flower shot. 6.  I think I''d score higher, but it doesn''t fit the theme as well as some of your competition</td>', 'Nice flower shot. 6.  I think I''d score higher, but it doesn''t fit the theme as well as some of your competition', '2008-04-04 12:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613605, 662568, 58457, '<td valign="top">Good color and interesting cloud shapes.  To score higher I''d like to see a little more going on w/ the landscape though.</td>', 'Good color and interesting cloud shapes.  To score higher I''d like to see a little more going on w/ the landscape though.', '2008-04-04 12:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613609, 663535, 58457, '<td valign="top">Nice close up.  I don''t know if your lighting could be softer or what, but I feel like it needs something to be a better shot.  Lots of close ups of flowers in this challenge, so check your competition for inspiration.</td>', 'Nice close up.  I don''t know if your lighting could be softer or what, but I feel like it needs something to be a better shot.  Lots of close ups of flowers in this challenge, so check your competition for inspiration.', '2008-04-04 12:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613614, 664816, 58457, '<td valign="top">I like the pattern that you acheive with this shot.  I''d maybe like to see the yellow a bit brighter.</td>', 'I like the pattern that you acheive with this shot.  I''d maybe like to see the yellow a bit brighter.', '2008-04-04 12:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613617, 664799, 58457, '<td valign="top">Yikes!  Interesting shot here, but I think I''d like to see it from a bit further away to maybe set it wherever it is a bit better.</td>', 'Yikes!  Interesting shot here, but I think I''d like to see it from a bit further away to maybe set it wherever it is a bit better.', '2008-04-04 12:13:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613619, 664425, 58457, '<td valign="top">Stong subtle yellows and yellow greens in this.  I wish the background had more color in it. 6</td>', 'Stong subtle yellows and yellow greens in this.  I wish the background had more color in it. 6', '2008-04-04 12:13:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613624, 663996, 58457, '<td valign="top">Nice close up.  The water droplets are crisp and they bead up quite well.  Originally scored this a 6, but I''m bumping to a 7, because in my voting scheme you deserve to be up a level higher than I originally put you.</td>', 'Nice close up.  The water droplets are crisp and they bead up quite well.  Originally scored this a 6, but I''m bumping to a 7, because in my voting scheme you deserve to be up a level higher than I originally put you.', '2008-04-04 12:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613626, 663051, 58457, '<td valign="top">Interesting macro, and funky shapes.  It doesn''t scream warmness to me the way some other shots in this challenge do though.  6.</td>', 'Interesting macro, and funky shapes.  It doesn''t scream warmness to me the way some other shots in this challenge do though.  6.', '2008-04-04 12:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613630, 663488, 58457, '<td valign="top">yikes.  Cool macro, but maybe not the best entry for warm colors.</td>', 'yikes.  Cool macro, but maybe not the best entry for warm colors.', '2008-04-04 12:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613634, 663962, 58457, '<td valign="top">Cool shapes in this silhouette and great sky. I think the bottom of the photo may be too black--it weighs a bit heavy for me.  6</td>', 'Cool shapes in this silhouette and great sky. I think the bottom of the photo may be too black--it weighs a bit heavy for me.  6', '2008-04-04 12:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613640, 664770, 58457, '<td valign="top">Good sky and silhouette.  I think your lighthouse may be <i>too</i> centered.  I think maybe a vertical crop w/ the lighthouse off centered could help the composition.</td>', 'Good sky and silhouette.  I think your lighthouse may be too centered.  I think maybe a vertical crop w/ the lighthouse off centered could help the composition.', '2008-04-04 12:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613643, 664690, 58457, '<td valign="top">Good simple flower shot on a nice background.  I like that your background has a radial gradient feel to it with the way you lit this.</td>', 'Good simple flower shot on a nice background.  I like that your background has a radial gradient feel to it with the way you lit this.', '2008-04-04 12:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613649, 665076, 58457, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept here.  A good attempt at a funky portrait set up, but maybe have be a bit noisy, pluse the lighting on the sheet next to her face creates a shape that to me is a bit harsh. 6</td>', 'Interesting concept here.  A good attempt at a funky portrait set up, but maybe have be a bit noisy, pluse the lighting on the sheet next to her face creates a shape that to me is a bit harsh. 6', '2008-04-04 12:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613653, 663527, 58457, '<td valign="top">Good shot  Could maybe be lightened up a bit.  I think you got bested by a few other close ups of flowers w/ water droplets in this challenge, though.</td>', 'Good shot  Could maybe be lightened up a bit.  I think you got bested by a few other close ups of flowers w/ water droplets in this challenge, though.', '2008-04-04 12:21:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613660, 664682, 58457, '<td valign="top">I like the cascade of fruit, but I think I''d fill the empty spots where you can see the surface. Also that background white is a bit harsh.  Also, I''d remove whatever that is in the lower right hand corner.</td>', 'I like the cascade of fruit, but I think I''d fill the empty spots where you can see the surface. Also that background white is a bit harsh.  Also, I''d remove whatever that is in the lower right hand corner.', '2008-04-04 12:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613668, 663425, 58457, '<td valign="top">Great shot, and I have no idea how you got above this bird and captured it as crisply as you did.  I also like the way the background looks like an impressionist painting.  However, I can''t score it as high as I may have as I don''t think it fits the theme as well as others in this challenge.  Still a stellar shot though. 6.</td>', 'Great shot, and I have no idea how you got above this bird and captured it as crisply as you did.  I also like the way the background looks like an impressionist painting.  However, I can''t score it as high as I may have as I don''t think it fits the theme as well as others in this challenge.  Still a stellar shot though. 6.', '2008-04-04 12:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613720, 664198, 58457, '<td valign="top">Nice close up and great pose on your model!</td>', 'Nice close up and great pose on your model!', '2008-04-04 12:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613721, 665041, 58457, '<td valign="top">Interesting color on this.  More of a soft pastely yellow. I think with how minimal the background is, I''d either like to see more of the vase or none at all.</td>', 'Interesting color on this.  More of a soft pastely yellow. I think with how minimal the background is, I''d either like to see more of the vase or none at all.', '2008-04-04 12:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613725, 664763, 58457, '<td valign="top">Crazy close up on that fly.  Really funky yellow greens in here too.</td>', 'Crazy close up on that fly.  Really funky yellow greens in here too.', '2008-04-04 12:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613726, 664873, 58457, '<td valign="top">Nice to use a red haired model in the warm challenge.  I think you may be the only one.</td>', 'Nice to use a red haired model in the warm challenge.  I think you may be the only one.', '2008-04-04 12:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613727, 663689, 58457, '<td valign="top">I really can''t decide whether or not I''d like to see his face.  Works well in this challenge, but I don''t know how well it would stand on its own.</td>', 'I really can''t decide whether or not I''d like to see his face.  Works well in this challenge, but I don''t know how well it would stand on its own.', '2008-04-04 12:50:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613730, 664792, 58457, '<td valign="top">Solid lines, really bland subject made more interesting by the crop and abstract nature of the photo. 6.</td>', 'Solid lines, really bland subject made more interesting by the crop and abstract nature of the photo. 6.', '2008-04-04 12:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613736, 664813, 58457, '<td valign="top">I''m not crazy about the subject matter but I like that the warm colors lighten up gradient style towards the top.</td>', 'I''m not crazy about the subject matter but I like that the warm colors lighten up gradient style towards the top.', '2008-04-04 12:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613740, 662755, 58457, '<td valign="top">I think your DOF is just a bit too shallow.  I like the little hairs, but I think I''d like just a touch more detail</td>', 'I think your DOF is just a bit too shallow.  I like the little hairs, but I think I''d like just a touch more detail', '2008-04-04 12:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613742, 664254, 58457, '<td valign="top">Interesting mixing of the red in clear, but I''m not sure the pedal does anything for you here.  I think I''d like it more at a lower angle and just the drips.</td>', 'Interesting mixing of the red in clear, but I''m not sure the pedal does anything for you here.  I think I''d like it more at a lower angle and just the drips.', '2008-04-04 12:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613744, 664738, 58457, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice, well centered, sharp composition.   definitely fits the theme too--originally scored this a 6, but when coming back to comment bumping up to a 7.</td>', 'This is a really nice, well centered, sharp composition.   definitely fits the theme too--originally scored this a 6, but when coming back to comment bumping up to a 7.', '2008-04-04 12:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613745, 662552, 58457, '<td valign="top">nice sky color but I think your silhouette is just too heavy.</td>', 'nice sky color but I think your silhouette is just too heavy.', '2008-04-04 12:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613747, 663181, 58457, '<td valign="top">good sharpness and variety on the pencils, but that center light is just too strong for me.</td>', 'good sharpness and variety on the pencils, but that center light is just too strong for me.', '2008-04-04 12:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613749, 662368, 58457, '<td valign="top">Decent shot, but the middle of the day lighting doesn''t help (not that he''d be under an umbrella at dusk, but, ah well)</td>', 'Decent shot, but the middle of the day lighting doesn''t help (not that he''d be under an umbrella at dusk, but, ah well)', '2008-04-04 12:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613753, 664570, 58457, '<td valign="top">nice shot for this couple if you know them, but not as strong as some of the other entries.</td>', 'nice shot for this couple if you know them, but not as strong as some of the other entries.', '2008-04-04 12:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613754, 664451, 58457, '<td valign="top">Lighting is a bit harsh and not quite the sharpest focus.</td>', 'Lighting is a bit harsh and not quite the sharpest focus.', '2008-04-04 12:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613761, 664784, 58457, '<td valign="top">nice shapes on the dunes, and the sand color is nice.  I''d like to see this at sunrise or set.</td>', 'nice shapes on the dunes, and the sand color is nice.  I''d like to see this at sunrise or set.', '2008-04-04 13:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613763, 662348, 58457, '<td valign="top">despite nothing going on in the water, you captured some nice shapes in the clouds and interesting light beams.</td>', 'despite nothing going on in the water, you captured some nice shapes in the clouds and interesting light beams.', '2008-04-04 13:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613766, 663683, 58457, '<td valign="top">interesting smoke and funky red light, i''m curious what you did.</td>', 'interesting smoke and funky red light, i''m curious what you did.', '2008-04-04 13:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613769, 664733, 58457, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see the tips of the pencils in sharper focus.</td>', 'I''d like to see the tips of the pencils in sharper focus.', '2008-04-04 13:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613770, 664978, 58457, '<td valign="top">Not as sharp as other flower entries, and your background is a bit noisy.  I like the colors though.</td>', 'Not as sharp as other flower entries, and your background is a bit noisy.  I like the colors though.', '2008-04-04 13:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4613772, 662794, 58457, '<td valign="top">I wish there were a bit more differentiation between the flowers.</td>', 'I wish there were a bit more differentiation between the flowers.', '2008-04-04 13:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
