(4613870, 664511, 58457, '<td valign="top">I like the layers of this picture--I first see the foreground calves and then discovered the blurry mama cow in the background.  Nice.  I may have cropped a bit tighter.</td>', 'I like the layers of this picture--I first see the foreground calves and then discovered the blurry mama cow in the background.  Nice.  I may have cropped a bit tighter.', '2008-04-04 13:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
