(4616316, 665108, 52549, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo of a beautiful dog. I wish the background was less cluttered but it''s o.k.</td>', 'Lovely photo of a beautiful dog. I wish the background was less cluttered but it''s o.k.', '2008-04-05 13:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4616320, 663986, 52549, '<td valign="top">Very pretty, love the angle.</td>', 'Very pretty, love the angle.', '2008-04-05 13:47:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4616328, 664857, 52549, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. This is a definite wall hanger.</td>', 'Beautiful. This is a definite wall hanger.', '2008-04-05 13:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4616337, 662727, 52549, '<td valign="top">Amazing photo. Maybe a tighter crop? The light stripe at the top and the OOF leaves at the bottom right are a bit distracting but still an amazing shot. Good luck.</td>', 'Amazing photo. Maybe a tighter crop? The light stripe at the top and the OOF leaves at the bottom right are a bit distracting but still an amazing shot. Good luck.', '2008-04-05 13:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4616339, 663687, 52549, '<td valign="top">What a gorgeous baby.</td>', 'What a gorgeous baby.', '2008-04-05 13:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4616342, 662545, 52549, '<td valign="top">Wow! Beautiful, my favourite as far.</td>', 'Wow! Beautiful, my favourite as far.', '2008-04-05 13:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4616345, 664873, 52549, '<td valign="top">Very, very nice.</td>', 'Very, very nice.', '2008-04-05 13:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4616350, 664229, 52549, '<td valign="top">Wow, now that''s what I call a colour clash ;-) You''re probably getting a lot of flack about the border colour..... however, I really like the placement of the flower in the image. I could see it hanging on the wall of a very modern room.</td>', 'Wow, now that''s what I call a colour clash ;-) You''re probably getting a lot of flack about the border colour..... however, I really like the placement of the flower in the image. I could see it hanging on the wall of a very modern room.', '2008-04-05 13:58:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4616351, 665079, 52549, '<td valign="top">Great focus, complementary colours, very nice, indeed.</td>', 'Great focus, complementary colours, very nice, indeed.', '2008-04-05 13:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4616352, 665108, 29513, '<td valign="top">Nice expression.  This guy is a great subject.  The lighting here seems a little harsh.  You might try light source offset to one side.  That would make great light/shadow play on the face.</td>', 'Nice expression.  This guy is a great subject.  The lighting here seems a little harsh.  You might try light source offset to one side.  That would make great light/shadow play on the face.', '2008-04-05 13:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4616353, 663683, 52549, '<td valign="top">I can see you put a lot of work into this. Pretty image but I think it would have been better without the pink halo. Good luck.</td>', 'I can see you put a lot of work into this. Pretty image but I think it would have been better without the pink halo. Good luck.', '2008-04-05 14:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4616356, 665013, 52549, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous colours. I''d have loved seeing the spray of the perfume.</td>', 'Gorgeous colours. I''d have loved seeing the spray of the perfume.', '2008-04-05 14:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4616357, 662519, 5094, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo but I would look much better if it had a sharper focus</td>', 'I really like this photo but I would look much better if it had a sharper focus', '2008-04-05 14:01:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4616358, 663948, 29513, '<td valign="top">Nice use of depth-of-field.  This has a lot of energy.  The face seems just a bit over exposed, though.  Great image.</td>', 'Nice use of depth-of-field.  This has a lot of energy.  The face seems just a bit over exposed, though.  Great image.', '2008-04-05 14:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4616360, 662606, 52549, '<td valign="top">This is a really superb image. I hope you ribbon with it.</td>', 'This is a really superb image. I hope you ribbon with it.', '2008-04-05 14:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4616361, 664412, 5094, '<td valign="top">I love love love Poutine!</td>', 'I love love love Poutine!', '2008-04-05 14:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4616362, 662791, 52549, '<td valign="top">Delightful.</td>', 'Delightful.', '2008-04-05 14:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4616365, 663192, 29513, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I really like the depth-of-field and the colors and framing.  Remember to be careful around trains.  They can be quieter that you think.</td>', 'Very nice.  I really like the depth-of-field and the colors and framing.  Remember to be careful around trains.  They can be quieter that you think.', '2008-04-05 14:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4616368, 664948, 52549, '<td valign="top">Great portrait and a beautiful woman but I hate the OOF yellow flowers in front of her chest.</td>', 'Great portrait and a beautiful woman but I hate the OOF yellow flowers in front of her chest.', '2008-04-05 14:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4616444, 664146, 90380, '<td valign="top">Very interesting plant! I think perhaps I would like to see it cropped a little tighter, both for composition and to minimize the distraction of the busy background. I like how you''ve got the beetles in there too, they really add to the interest imo.</td>', 'Very interesting plant! I think perhaps I would like to see it cropped a little tighter, both for composition and to minimize the distraction of the busy background. I like how you''ve got the beetles in there too, they really add to the interest imo.', '2008-04-05 14:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4616447, 663763, 90380, '<td valign="top">Partylite? :-)</td>', 'Partylite? :-)', '2008-04-05 14:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4616452, 663307, 90495, '<td valign="top">Nice comp but too many hot spots.</td>', 'Nice comp but too many hot spots.', '2008-04-05 14:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4616455, 664779, 90380, '<td valign="top">Excellent action freeze, and I like how the tail sticks straight out, giving it the impression of speed. I''ve never seen a horse have such bright blue eyes! He/she just looks so snuggleable :-)</td>', 'Excellent action freeze, and I like how the tail sticks straight out, giving it the impression of speed. I''ve never seen a horse have such bright blue eyes! He/she just looks so snuggleable :-)', '2008-04-05 14:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4616464, 664848, 90495, '<td valign="top">Very well done. I happened along this tutorial today actually.  I would have liked to see more of a difference between the red and orange pencils though. But I know how hard these colours can be to photograph together. Also, the same amount of shadow on the orange pencil as on the others, would have balanced it out even more. 9.4</td>', 'Very well done. I happened along this tutorial today actually.  I would have liked to see more of a difference between the red and orange pencils though. But I know how hard these colours can be to photograph together. Also, the same amount of shadow on the orange pencil as on the others, would have balanced it out even more. 9.4', '2008-04-05 14:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4616468, 663428, 90495, '<td valign="top">It''s as though there''s a black hole in the middle of this image. Great capture.</td>', 'It''s as though there''s a black hole in the middle of this image. Great capture.', '2008-04-05 14:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4616472, 664414, 90380, '<td valign="top">Great pink!</td>', 'Great pink!', '2008-04-05 14:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4616474, 664254, 90495, '<td valign="top">Blood! arrgghh Lovely colours and great ripples.</td>', 'Blood! arrgghh Lovely colours and great ripples.', '2008-04-05 14:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4616477, 663971, 90495, '<td valign="top">Great capture and well done. Good composition makes it all work for me.</td>', 'Great capture and well done. Good composition makes it all work for me.', '2008-04-05 15:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4616479, 665141, 90495, '<td valign="top">Thought this was a pic of flames at first. Good one.</td>', 'Thought this was a pic of flames at first. Good one.', '2008-04-05 15:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4616482, 664412, 90495, '<td valign="top">Poutine? My heart..... Lovely colours and textures.</td>', 'Poutine? My heart..... Lovely colours and textures.', '2008-04-05 15:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4616484, 663763, 90495, '<td valign="top">I feel the warmth, imagine if they were lit? Good image and idea.</td>', 'I feel the warmth, imagine if they were lit? Good image and idea.', '2008-04-05 15:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4616486, 663692, 90495, '<td valign="top">A little flat I would say. There, I said it. A little leveling in PS or whatever, would have helped a ton.</td>', 'A little flat I would say. There, I said it. A little leveling in PS or whatever, would have helped a ton.', '2008-04-05 15:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4616488, 664360, 90495, '<td valign="top">The bright unfocused flowers grab our attention right off the bat. The rest of the image is nice.</td>', 'The bright unfocused flowers grab our attention right off the bat. The rest of the image is nice.', '2008-04-05 15:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4616495, 662791, 68648, '<td valign="top">we</td>', 'we', '2008-04-05 15:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4616509, 664831, 90380, '<td valign="top">Great shot, beautiful flower, composition, everything! The funny thing is, the colours appeared to be a bit dull to me, but I didn''t think this photographer would have settled for dull colours, so I tried opening it up in photoshop, and alas, it appeared much more clear and vibrant. I have more to learn about this, but I think it has something to do with colour spaces. Bottom line, I am not penalizing for the colour appearance, but you might want to keep that in mind in case others see the same phenomenon (perhaps it is only my computer??). Off to do research!</td>', 'Great shot, beautiful flower, composition, everything! The funny thing is, the colours appeared to be a bit dull to me, but I didn''t think this photographer would have settled for dull colours, so I tried opening it up in photoshop, and alas, it appeared much more clear and vibrant. I have more to learn about this, but I think it has something to do with colour spaces. Bottom line, I am not penalizing for the colour appearance, but you might want to keep that in mind in case others see the same phenomenon (perhaps it is only my computer??). Off to do research!', '2008-04-05 15:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4616511, 663046, 90380, '<td valign="top">Kinky ;)</td>', 'Kinky ;)', '2008-04-05 15:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
