(4617956, 664238, 47852, '<td valign="top">Like that you used a hot item to go with the warm colors, and that the light is in a shape that mimics the pepper.  Seems the contrast is a bit too much since there are patches of blown out colors/highlights, especially depending what angle my laptop screen is at.</td>', 'Like that you used a hot item to go with the warm colors, and that the light is in a shape that mimics the pepper.  Seems the contrast is a bit too much since there are patches of blown out colors/highlights, especially depending what angle my laptop screen is at.', '2008-04-06 09:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617962, 664791, 47852, '<td valign="top">Lovely warm autumn colors... not sure about the horizontal placement in the frame.. perhaps a diagonal composition would be nice?</td>', 'Lovely warm autumn colors... not sure about the horizontal placement in the frame.. perhaps a diagonal composition would be nice?', '2008-04-06 09:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617964, 664267, 47852, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t scream warm colors to me, in fact the focus on the balloon and the shadow it casts are cool colors.  I think it''s hard to take something with so many colors and make it work for either of these particular challenges.</td>', 'This doesn''t scream warm colors to me, in fact the focus on the balloon and the shadow it casts are cool colors.  I think it''s hard to take something with so many colors and make it work for either of these particular challenges.', '2008-04-06 09:49:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617970, 664846, 47852, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, and has an overall warm feel, though I don''t know that it was accomplished through the use of color.  I like that her arm is extended and her gaze also leads you to the flower she is looking at.  I wish her other hand was folded in or something so it wasn''t chopped off, and I would have had her fix the shirt to cover up the strap!</td>', 'Lovely shot, and has an overall warm feel, though I don''t know that it was accomplished through the use of color.  I like that her arm is extended and her gaze also leads you to the flower she is looking at.  I wish her other hand was folded in or something so it wasn''t chopped off, and I would have had her fix the shirt to cover up the strap!', '2008-04-06 09:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617975, 664368, 47852, '<td valign="top">I like the negative space here, and that the stem is out of focus, leaving all of the focus on the red flower.  As a whole shot though, I find that there isn''t a lot to hold my attention.</td>', 'I like the negative space here, and that the stem is out of focus, leaving all of the focus on the red flower.  As a whole shot though, I find that there isn''t a lot to hold my attention.', '2008-04-06 09:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617979, 664770, 47852, '<td valign="top">Great warm colors here, and I like the way the pier leads out to the lighthouse.  I''m not sure if I would have preferred the sun to be completely behind the lighthouse, since it feels a bit off with it only peeking out from one side.  Looks like the clouds cooperated here too, giving just a touch of interest to the sky.</td>', 'Great warm colors here, and I like the way the pier leads out to the lighthouse.  I''m not sure if I would have preferred the sun to be completely behind the lighthouse, since it feels a bit off with it only peeking out from one side.  Looks like the clouds cooperated here too, giving just a touch of interest to the sky.', '2008-04-06 09:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617985, 664701, 47852, '<td valign="top">I''m not really sure what this is, but it seems to have a combination of warm and cool colors, though you focused in on the warm.  It looks like it has some interesting textures, and while I''m usually a fan of shallow dof, it may have been neat to see more of the texture here.</td>', 'I''m not really sure what this is, but it seems to have a combination of warm and cool colors, though you focused in on the warm.  It looks like it has some interesting textures, and while I''m usually a fan of shallow dof, it may have been neat to see more of the texture here.', '2008-04-06 09:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617989, 662918, 47852, '<td valign="top">This little guy posed very nicely for you!  Great focus and love how you can almost feel the feathers on his neck.  I''m not sure about the completely centered composition here, but I do like the long portrait orientation.  This would be great for the color on color challenges too... he blends in well!</td>', 'This little guy posed very nicely for you!  Great focus and love how you can almost feel the feathers on his neck.  I''m not sure about the completely centered composition here, but I do like the long portrait orientation.  This would be great for the color on color challenges too... he blends in well!', '2008-04-06 10:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617993, 663414, 47852, '<td valign="top">Like the composition here... and he looks like he''s just barely hanging on!  The greens give a nice blip of contrast to the warm browns too.</td>', 'Like the composition here... and he looks like he''s just barely hanging on!  The greens give a nice blip of contrast to the warm browns too.', '2008-04-06 10:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4617999, 664697, 47852, '<td valign="top">Great choice of background color to complete a warm feel with the peppers.  Something with the water drops feels out of place here... perhaps the way they pool up once they slide off the peppers.</td>', 'Great choice of background color to complete a warm feel with the peppers.  Something with the water drops feels out of place here... perhaps the way they pool up once they slide off the peppers.', '2008-04-06 10:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618002, 665079, 47852, '<td valign="top">Wow... first reaction is that the flower doesn''t belong in the ''warm colors'' challenge, but somehow this manages to have a warm feel to me.  Nice gradient of orange in the background.  I guess the odd looking edges of the petals come from the fact that this is floating in water?</td>', 'Wow... first reaction is that the flower doesn''t belong in the ''warm colors'' challenge, but somehow this manages to have a warm feel to me.  Nice gradient of orange in the background.  I guess the odd looking edges of the petals come from the fact that this is floating in water?', '2008-04-06 10:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618008, 664947, 47852, '<td valign="top">Lots of warm colors here, and I like that you chose to add the seams.  I would have shot this on a diagonal though I think, and I think if it were a bit sharper, we could really see the textures of the stitching.</td>', 'Lots of warm colors here, and I like that you chose to add the seams.  I would have shot this on a diagonal though I think, and I think if it were a bit sharper, we could really see the textures of the stitching.', '2008-04-06 10:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618013, 664761, 47852, '<td valign="top">Great warm colors.. love the diagonal composition, and you left the perfect amount of the door in to give a bit of extra interest.  Nicely done!</td>', 'Great warm colors.. love the diagonal composition, and you left the perfect amount of the door in to give a bit of extra interest.  Nicely done!', '2008-04-06 10:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618015, 664690, 47852, '<td valign="top">Great warm colors here both in the flower and the background.  Love the gradient of color on the petals too.  Wish this was just a tad sharper, even if only in one spot with a shallow dof.</td>', 'Great warm colors here both in the flower and the background.  Love the gradient of color on the petals too.  Wish this was just a tad sharper, even if only in one spot with a shallow dof.', '2008-04-06 10:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618023, 664400, 47852, '<td valign="top">This shot is clearly enhanced by the title... I had to go back and compare to see what you''d chosen for each.  I''m not sure about the background choice, and wish the lighting wasn''t quite as harsh on the little smiley heads.  Overall though, definitely meets the challenge, and it gave me a chuckle! :)</td>', 'This shot is clearly enhanced by the title... I had to go back and compare to see what you''d chosen for each.  I''m not sure about the background choice, and wish the lighting wasn''t quite as harsh on the little smiley heads.  Overall though, definitely meets the challenge, and it gave me a chuckle! :)', '2008-04-06 10:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618028, 664647, 47852, '<td valign="top">Love the shallow dof here, and the orange colors of the flowers.  The leaves have a bit of a bluish tint to them, and I wonder if adjusting the white balance in camera or doing a slight hue adjustment would have given this shot an even warm overall feel.</td>', 'Love the shallow dof here, and the orange colors of the flowers.  The leaves have a bit of a bluish tint to them, and I wonder if adjusting the white balance in camera or doing a slight hue adjustment would have given this shot an even warm overall feel.', '2008-04-06 10:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618047, 664146, 47852, '<td valign="top">Great flower with lots of interesting textures and lines.  I would have liked a tighter crop, to really see all of that a little closer up, and it also would have really focused in on the warm red color.</td>', 'Great flower with lots of interesting textures and lines.  I would have liked a tighter crop, to really see all of that a little closer up, and it also would have really focused in on the warm red color.', '2008-04-06 10:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618073, 663192, 47852, '<td valign="top">Great dof here, and love the textures of the metal.  The rust is the perfect color for this challenge!  Very nicely done! :)</td>', 'Great dof here, and love the textures of the metal.  The rust is the perfect color for this challenge!  Very nicely done! :)', '2008-04-06 10:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618074, 663986, 47852, '<td valign="top">Warm colors, warm glow, warm feel... very nice.  The shapes here are interesting and the composition works nicely.  Only complaint is the lines on the top, which I would guess are the corner of the wall and the trim at the ceiling.  Great job!</td>', 'Warm colors, warm glow, warm feel... very nice.  The shapes here are interesting and the composition works nicely.  Only complaint is the lines on the top, which I would guess are the corner of the wall and the trim at the ceiling.  Great job!', '2008-04-06 10:44:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618076, 664813, 47852, '<td valign="top">Love the warm colors, and the stacking makes for a lovely gradient.  Lots of abstract shapes and bits of darker colors here from the overlap.  A wonderful and unique idea... well done!</td>', 'Love the warm colors, and the stacking makes for a lovely gradient.  Lots of abstract shapes and bits of darker colors here from the overlap.  A wonderful and unique idea... well done!', '2008-04-06 10:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618077, 664993, 47852, '<td valign="top">This is lovely!  The more I look at it, the more things I find interesting.  The fish is perfectly placed, looking out of his bowl longingly, the colors in the cloth are all warm and fit the challenge perfectly, and the contrast in texture between the smooth bowl and the cloth is great too.  Great job!</td>', 'This is lovely!  The more I look at it, the more things I find interesting.  The fish is perfectly placed, looking out of his bowl longingly, the colors in the cloth are all warm and fit the challenge perfectly, and the contrast in texture between the smooth bowl and the cloth is great too.  Great job!', '2008-04-06 10:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618087, 665108, 47852, '<td valign="top">Adorable!!  Good choice to put him on a yellow blanket to help boost that warm feel for this challenge.  Lighting is a bit harsh, probably from the onboard flash.  Perhaps just holding a piece of paper in front of the flash would help diffuse it a little?</td>', 'Adorable!!  Good choice to put him on a yellow blanket to help boost that warm feel for this challenge.  Lighting is a bit harsh, probably from the onboard flash.  Perhaps just holding a piece of paper in front of the flash would help diffuse it a little?', '2008-04-06 10:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618088, 664779, 47852, '<td valign="top">Interesting example of how using warm colors can still have a cold feel.  Love the stopped motion and the alert eyes... this one just makes me smile :)</td>', 'Interesting example of how using warm colors can still have a cold feel.  Love the stopped motion and the alert eyes... this one just makes me smile :)', '2008-04-06 10:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618089, 663821, 47852, '<td valign="top">Not sure that this is a monarch, but it''s certainly a great shot of a butterfly!  Love the warm yellows that peek through the background, and the hints of red on the wings too.</td>', 'Not sure that this is a monarch, but it''s certainly a great shot of a butterfly!  Love the warm yellows that peek through the background, and the hints of red on the wings too.', '2008-04-06 10:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618090, 664511, 47852, '<td valign="top">Cute!  Love the bigger cow in the background watching over the smaller ones, and the dof is great.</td>', 'Cute!  Love the bigger cow in the background watching over the smaller ones, and the dof is great.', '2008-04-06 10:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618091, 663307, 47852, '<td valign="top">Lovely spring shot, and the yellow tones definitely give it a warm feel.  Wish it was a tad less bright though, especially on the left.</td>', 'Lovely spring shot, and the yellow tones definitely give it a warm feel.  Wish it was a tad less bright though, especially on the left.', '2008-04-06 10:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618094, 663763, 47852, '<td valign="top">Love the arrangement here... you clearly took the time to line up all the wicks so they pointed in the same direction which gives it a nice, clean look.  Perfect choice of colors too for the challenge!</td>', 'Love the arrangement here... you clearly took the time to line up all the wicks so they pointed in the same direction which gives it a nice, clean look.  Perfect choice of colors too for the challenge!', '2008-04-06 10:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618126, 664500, 47852, '<td valign="top">Stunning!  Very Ursula-esque!  Love the warm glow, and the shadows that the petals create on each other.  One of my top 2 :)</td>', 'Stunning!  Very Ursula-esque!  Love the warm glow, and the shadows that the petals create on each other.  One of my top 2 :)', '2008-04-06 11:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618129, 663971, 47852, '<td valign="top">Great warm colors all the way through this shot, and I love the shape you captured in the flames.   Great job! :)</td>', 'Great warm colors all the way through this shot, and I love the shape you captured in the flames.   Great job! :)', '2008-04-06 11:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618137, 662807, 41206, '<td valign="top">meets the challenge, but just doesn''t show much creativity</td>', 'meets the challenge, but just doesn''t show much creativity', '2008-04-06 11:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618140, 664293, 41206, '<td valign="top">exposure ok, composition not. Partial animal in background distracts from subject, dog is looking out of the photo and too close to right edge, if the person was shown in photo, then it would be way more interesting...</td>', 'exposure ok, composition not. Partial animal in background distracts from subject, dog is looking out of the photo and too close to right edge, if the person was shown in photo, then it would be way more interesting...', '2008-04-06 11:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
