(4618552, 663741, 83313, '<td valign="top">Agghhhh!!!! A wax museum?</td>', 'Agghhhh!!!! A wax museum?', '2008-04-06 15:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618584, 664110, 83313, '<td valign="top">Yes, it meets the challenge, but I don''t find it terribly creative. There''s also a ton of compression artifacts visible.</td>', 'Yes, it meets the challenge, but I don''t find it terribly creative. There''s also a ton of compression artifacts visible.', '2008-04-06 15:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618590, 664254, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice variation the the drop shot.</td>', 'Nice variation the the drop shot.', '2008-04-06 15:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618592, 665111, 83313, '<td valign="top">A nice image and a + for the unique humor value.</td>', 'A nice image and a + for the unique humor value.', '2008-04-06 15:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618596, 664985, 83313, '<td valign="top">A cute shot, she looks like she was having fun. However, it seems to be just a good snapshot.</td>', 'A cute shot, she looks like she was having fun. However, it seems to be just a good snapshot.', '2008-04-06 15:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618604, 664414, 83313, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge, thought adjusting a monochrome color tone is not along the lines of what I was expecting. Still, to be fair, it''s not like sunsets aren''t heavily tweaked to present unnatural levels of orange. <br/> <br/>Overall, this is pleasing, but I find the lighthouse to be way too far over to the right. I think a different crop was really in order here.</td>', 'Meets the challenge, thought adjusting a monochrome color tone is not along the lines of what I was expecting. Still, to be fair, it''s not like sunsets aren''t heavily tweaked to present unnatural levels of orange.  Overall, this is pleasing, but I find the lighthouse to be way too far over to the right. I think a different crop was really in order here.', '2008-04-06 15:41:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618607, 664239, 83313, '<td valign="top">Can''t get much warmer than this. I wonder though, what would have happened if you''d entered a blue flame in this challenge?</td>', 'Can''t get much warmer than this. I wonder though, what would have happened if you''d entered a blue flame in this challenge?', '2008-04-06 15:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618613, 663192, 83313, '<td valign="top">Orange rust and sunset color glow. I like the details showing, though I may have cropped it a little closer myself. I find my eye is drawn up the rail, toward the out of focus area. Cropping a little off the top and placing the bolts a bit more to the right may help the visual flow better. Still a good one, in spite of my nitpicks.</td>', 'Orange rust and sunset color glow. I like the details showing, though I may have cropped it a little closer myself. I find my eye is drawn up the rail, toward the out of focus area. Cropping a little off the top and placing the bolts a bit more to the right may help the visual flow better. Still a good one, in spite of my nitpicks.', '2008-04-06 15:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618617, 663689, 83313, '<td valign="top">The way in which his head is cut off from the frame seems odd and does not work for me. Perhaps a closer, detail view would have worked better.</td>', 'The way in which his head is cut off from the frame seems odd and does not work for me. Perhaps a closer, detail view would have worked better.', '2008-04-06 15:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618627, 664360, 83313, '<td valign="top">Your file size is only 29k when you could have used up to 150k. This indicates a lot of JPEG compression, which is taking a lot of detail out of your photo. Look at the pixellation visible around some of the flowers edges and you will see what I am referring to. Check the JPEG compression settings in your image editor and always try to save as close to the limit for a challenge as you can get it without going over.<br/> <br/>Also, the focus is a little off. the eye is drawn to a part of the flower that is not quite in focus. Having the flower in focus and the girl a little blurry may have worked better here.</td>', 'Your file size is only 29k when you could have used up to 150k. This indicates a lot of JPEG compression, which is taking a lot of detail out of your photo. Look at the pixellation visible around some of the flowers edges and you will see what I am referring to. Check the JPEG compression settings in your image editor and always try to save as close to the limit for a challenge as you can get it without going over. Also, the focus is a little off. the eye is drawn to a part of the flower that is not quite in focus. Having the flower in focus and the girl a little blurry may have worked better here.', '2008-04-06 15:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618632, 665001, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''d like to know how you did this within basic rules. I can see what looks like selection edges, but it''s been validated, so you did something else. <br/> <br/>Lots of impact in this one, I like it. Biggest flaw I can see is the previously mentioned hard edges around the edges of the petals.</td>', 'I''d like to know how you did this within basic rules. I can see what looks like selection edges, but it''s been validated, so you did something else.  Lots of impact in this one, I like it. Biggest flaw I can see is the previously mentioned hard edges around the edges of the petals.', '2008-04-06 15:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618634, 662799, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice colorful blur. Seems to be maybe a little too much empty space on the left.</td>', 'Nice colorful blur. Seems to be maybe a little too much empty space on the left.', '2008-04-06 15:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618638, 664753, 83313, '<td valign="top">Great details in this. Soft and sharp as well. I suspect this was the sharpness from a good lens and good use of camera settings. I''ll be checking back on this one for some details after the challenge. Oh, also an fave for this.</td>', 'Great details in this. Soft and sharp as well. I suspect this was the sharpness from a good lens and good use of camera settings. I''ll be checking back on this one for some details after the challenge. Oh, also an fave for this.', '2008-04-06 15:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618640, 663353, 83313, '<td valign="top">An interesting scene, but seems a little soft. The mural appears to be more the subject than the copper pots.</td>', 'An interesting scene, but seems a little soft. The mural appears to be more the subject than the copper pots.', '2008-04-06 16:01:05.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4618647, 662606, 83313, '<td valign="top">I would have thought this was a long exposure, except for the birds in flight. I''ll be looking for some details on how you did this after the challenge.</td>', 'I would have thought this was a long exposure, except for the birds in flight. I''ll be looking for some details on how you did this after the challenge.', '2008-04-06 16:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618946, 664780, 39663, '<td valign="top">So warm and dreamy. That plane trail is just the perfect trail to follow with the eye. Like taking a walk through your photo. Thanks.</td>', 'So warm and dreamy. That plane trail is just the perfect trail to follow with the eye. Like taking a walk through your photo. Thanks.', '2008-04-06 19:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618951, 662727, 39663, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot! Horny little guy and cute too. Don''t see much warm colors though unless you meant the heat of that day.</td>', 'Very interesting shot! Horny little guy and cute too. Don''t see much warm colors though unless you meant the heat of that day.', '2008-04-06 19:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4618974, 664948, 53316, '<td valign="top">I think the way that the bottom is soft focus, and the chin blends into the other skin, is a really neat way of presenting this.  It''s quite unique and I think it really works here.</td>', 'I think the way that the bottom is soft focus, and the chin blends into the other skin, is a really neat way of presenting this.  It''s quite unique and I think it really works here.', '2008-04-06 19:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4619003, 664955, 90495, '<td valign="top">Warm colours abound in this shot. Nice to see different warm colours for a change.</td>', 'Warm colours abound in this shot. Nice to see different warm colours for a change.', '2008-04-06 20:11:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4619005, 662552, 90495, '<td valign="top">Wow what a deep orange sky that is. Darn roof kind of kills the beauty a bit but a good shot all the same.</td>', 'Wow what a deep orange sky that is. Darn roof kind of kills the beauty a bit but a good shot all the same.', '2008-04-06 20:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4619008, 664927, 90495, '<td valign="top">I''m asking myself this; why deliberately make this oof? For art''s sake? I do not see this as adding any value or beauty to this image. sorry</td>', 'I''m asking myself this; why deliberately make this oof? For art''s sake? I do not see this as adding any value or beauty to this image. sorry', '2008-04-06 20:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4619009, 664146, 90495, '<td valign="top">Lovely.</td>', 'Lovely.', '2008-04-06 20:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4619036, 662399, 90495, '<td valign="top">Bird feeders kill any bird shot imo. Good action from these 2 chickadees.</td>', 'Bird feeders kill any bird shot imo. Good action from these 2 chickadees.', '2008-04-06 20:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4619045, 664411, 90495, '<td valign="top">Very crisp shot. Focus is spot on. I can''t find one nitpick to pick on but I will say this, I''m going to try this i''m so impressed. niner</td>', 'Very crisp shot. Focus is spot on. I can''t find one nitpick to pick on but I will say this, I''m going to try this i''m so impressed. niner', '2008-04-06 20:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4619056, 663231, 90495, '<td valign="top">Nice comp.I get the feeling he''s walking up a slight hill. Or is it just a slight tilt attributable to your camera?</td>', 'Nice comp.I get the feeling he''s walking up a slight hill. Or is it just a slight tilt attributable to your camera?', '2008-04-06 20:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4619060, 663195, 90495, '<td valign="top">Now if this were a sunrise....</td>', 'Now if this were a sunrise....', '2008-04-06 20:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4619075, 664738, 90495, '<td valign="top">This is nice but after seeing the other closeup cat shots on this site I see now why the really good ones stand out. Both eyes are illuminated evenly, giving a symmetrical aspect to the image, which is always pleasing to the eye no matter how the symmetry is conveyed. Your cat''s eyes are not lit up the same and that''s what hit me right off the bat. A pleasing capture all the same for a <i>Warm Colours</i> <i>challenge.</i></td>', 'This is nice but after seeing the other closeup cat shots on this site I see now why the really good ones stand out. Both eyes are illuminated evenly, giving a symmetrical aspect to the image, which is always pleasing to the eye no matter how the symmetry is conveyed. Your cat''s eyes are not lit up the same and that''s what hit me right off the bat. A pleasing capture all the same for a Warm Colours challenge.', '2008-04-06 20:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4619392, 664257, 92285, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, would make an awesome painting also</td>', 'Beautiful, would make an awesome painting also', '2008-04-06 23:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4619580, 664522, 90387, '<td valign="top">Great idea!!!  I tried something similar, but didn''t submit it.  Did the crayon fall right out of the pan when it cooled?  Great job!</td>', 'Great idea!!!  I tried something similar, but didn''t submit it.  Did the crayon fall right out of the pan when it cooled?  Great job!', '2008-04-07 00:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4619596, 663945, 90387, '<td valign="top">I love this shot, though it looks like you might have had some spray or mist on the lens? As a surfer, I may be biased!  Good luck!</td>', 'I love this shot, though it looks like you might have had some spray or mist on the lens? As a surfer, I may be biased!  Good luck!', '2008-04-07 00:27:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4619606, 662622, 90387, '<td valign="top">Great image!  Wish that street lamp weren''t there, but don''t know if you could have composed it any differently?</td>', 'Great image!  Wish that street lamp weren''t there, but don''t know if you could have composed it any differently?', '2008-04-07 00:30:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4619607, 663971, 90387, '<td valign="top">Great shot, and well titled.  I''ll be looking for this on the front page tomorrow!</td>', 'Great shot, and well titled.  I''ll be looking for this on the front page tomorrow!', '2008-04-07 00:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
