(4620933, 663971, 45198, '<td valign="top">Seen this picture concept in DPC but still it is a good reproduction. Well done.</td>', 'Seen this picture concept in DPC but still it is a good reproduction. Well done.', '2008-04-07 12:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4620936, 665111, 45198, '<td valign="top">Cool shoot - I hope you didn''t burn your house ...</td>', 'Cool shoot - I hope you didn''t burn your house ...', '2008-04-07 12:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4620938, 663724, 45198, '<td valign="top">A crop from the top would improve this picture.</td>', 'A crop from the top would improve this picture.', '2008-04-07 13:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4621048, 664780, 35034, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely picture, but I wish you had not done quite so much playing with the color--a little can go a long way.  a 6</td>', 'This is a lovely picture, but I wish you had not done quite so much playing with the color--a little can go a long way.  a 6', '2008-04-07 14:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4621074, 664831, 83313, '<td valign="top">The warm pinks did not come across as much as they needed to here. Though the subject is meant to be a warm color, the predominant shade is green. Still, it''s a nice image. I like the drop sliding off the leaf.</td>', 'The warm pinks did not come across as much as they needed to here. Though the subject is meant to be a warm color, the predominant shade is green. Still, it''s a nice image. I like the drop sliding off the leaf.', '2008-04-07 14:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4621077, 663763, 83313, '<td valign="top">Would have also been a good one for the patterns challenge. Nice and sharp, lots of detail.</td>', 'Would have also been a good one for the patterns challenge. Nice and sharp, lots of detail.', '2008-04-07 14:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4621084, 664947, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks like a blanket or furniture cover perhaps? I''m afraid this is a bit lacking in both interest and sharpness. The colors are nice and bold, though.</td>', 'Looks like a blanket or furniture cover perhaps? I''m afraid this is a bit lacking in both interest and sharpness. The colors are nice and bold, though.', '2008-04-07 14:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4621088, 664146, 83313, '<td valign="top">Neat looking plant. What is it? The bugs are kind of cool looking as well. Did you get any macros of them while you were at it? I''d love to see those close up.</td>', 'Neat looking plant. What is it? The bugs are kind of cool looking as well. Did you get any macros of them while you were at it? I''d love to see those close up.', '2008-04-07 14:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4621094, 664257, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice bold sunset colors. To be honest though, a sunset really needs to be outstanding and different, since it is so easy to get awesome colors from one.</td>', 'Nice bold sunset colors. To be honest though, a sunset really needs to be outstanding and different, since it is so easy to get awesome colors from one.', '2008-04-07 14:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4621097, 664538, 83313, '<td valign="top">Ok, I''m feeling warm...</td>', 'Ok, I''m feeling warm...', '2008-04-07 14:30:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4621105, 665136, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m not even sure what this is. A car perhaps? The image looks both softly pixelated and oversharp in some areas. The red is nice and strong though.</td>', 'I''m not even sure what this is. A car perhaps? The image looks both softly pixelated and oversharp in some areas. The red is nice and strong though.', '2008-04-07 14:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4621106, 664991, 83313, '<td valign="top">A lot of delicate detail. Great DOF usage.</td>', 'A lot of delicate detail. Great DOF usage.', '2008-04-07 14:33:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4621109, 662727, 91730, '<td valign="top">I give you kudos for the weird bug thing. What the hell is that?? I''m stumped...</td>', 'I give you kudos for the weird bug thing. What the hell is that?? I''m stumped...', '2008-04-07 14:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4621110, 663195, 83313, '<td valign="top">Sunsets are hard to do in a unique and interesting way, but I think you nailed this one.</td>', 'Sunsets are hard to do in a unique and interesting way, but I think you nailed this one.', '2008-04-07 14:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4621112, 664799, 83313, '<td valign="top">So, where''s the warm colors? ;-}   <br/>Hope you got this with a nice long zoom. I have a coworker who is a volunteer firefighter and he is always in the middle of these things.</td>', 'So, where''s the warm colors? ;-}   Hope you got this with a nice long zoom. I have a coworker who is a volunteer firefighter and he is always in the middle of these things.', '2008-04-07 14:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4621114, 665143, 83313, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit dark towards the right side. Interesting looking bird. What is it?</td>', 'Seems a bit dark towards the right side. Interesting looking bird. What is it?', '2008-04-07 14:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4621121, 663692, 83313, '<td valign="top">Seems to be a snapshot, I''m afraid. Not sure what to suggest with this one. Perhaps a close in perspective view that shows the patterns of the plaything would work. Cropping of the subject seems a bit too far over to the left.</td>', 'Seems to be a snapshot, I''m afraid. Not sure what to suggest with this one. Perhaps a close in perspective view that shows the patterns of the plaything would work. Cropping of the subject seems a bit too far over to the left.', '2008-04-07 14:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4621130, 665003, 83313, '<td valign="top">Focus was a little off. If it were on the near eye, it would be great. Nice details showing. <br/> <br/>For those voters who did not see the relevance of this image to the challenge, BROWN IS A WARM COLOR! (You might think my own entry got nailed in the same way...)</td>', 'Focus was a little off. If it were on the near eye, it would be great. Nice details showing.  For those voters who did not see the relevance of this image to the challenge, BROWN IS A WARM COLOR! (You might think my own entry got nailed in the same way...)', '2008-04-07 14:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4621132, 664896, 85848, '<td valign="top">I like the pic a lot, but it''s more cool than warm.</td>', 'I like the pic a lot, but it''s more cool than warm.', '2008-04-07 14:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4621134, 662794, 83313, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit soft and lacking detail. The file size is ok, but it looks like it lost a lot to JPEG compression somewhere else along the way, before the final save.</td>', 'Seems a bit soft and lacking detail. The file size is ok, but it looks like it lost a lot to JPEG compression somewhere else along the way, before the final save.', '2008-04-07 14:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4621144, 662800, 83313, '<td valign="top">Shows some camera shake, but I think there are some folks who will really like this one. I''m not one of them I''m afraid. I do like the perspective and the scene overall, but the camera blur kills it for me.</td>', 'Shows some camera shake, but I think there are some folks who will really like this one. I''m not one of them I''m afraid. I do like the perspective and the scene overall, but the camera blur kills it for me.', '2008-04-07 14:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4621147, 664522, 83313, '<td valign="top">Can I eat one now, huh, huh, can I?</td>', 'Can I eat one now, huh, huh, can I?', '2008-04-07 14:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4621154, 663401, 83313, '<td valign="top">Pretty blossoms. However, the composition of this shot, or lack of it, screams "snapshot". The yellow against red makes a wonderful contrast, though.</td>', 'Pretty blossoms. However, the composition of this shot, or lack of it, screams "snapshot". The yellow against red makes a wonderful contrast, though.', '2008-04-07 14:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4621158, 663094, 92203, '<td valign="top">Such a beautiful image. Its a shame that you kept the wall in on the right hand side...it becomes quite distracting.</td>', 'Such a beautiful image. Its a shame that you kept the wall in on the right hand side...it becomes quite distracting.', '2008-04-07 14:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4621166, 663401, 92203, '<td valign="top">Great image, shame about the reflection the in rear windscreen. Wing mirror is a slight distraction. Well done.</td>', 'Great image, shame about the reflection the in rear windscreen. Wing mirror is a slight distraction. Well done.', '2008-04-07 14:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4621167, 664682, 92203, '<td valign="top">A real sense of warmth.</td>', 'A real sense of warmth.', '2008-04-07 14:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
