(4622298, 663414, 90806, '<td valign="top">Great shot, beautiful subject and unambiguously warm colors.  I love the foreground wing detail and leg barbs.</td>', 'Great shot, beautiful subject and unambiguously warm colors.  I love the foreground wing detail and leg barbs.', '2008-04-07 23:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
