(4622302, 664893, 90806, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  An even tighter crop with just oranges and yellows in the sky might have made for a more prominent sun and overall warmer colors, if detail would have allow for it.  Excellent as it is though.</td>', 'Beautiful.  An even tighter crop with just oranges and yellows in the sky might have made for a more prominent sun and overall warmer colors, if detail would have allow for it.  Excellent as it is though.', '2008-04-07 23:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
