(4622312, 664586, 90806, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo.  It doesn''t scream warm colors, but they are subtly and effectively throughout.  Excellent.</td>', 'Beautiful photo.  It doesn''t scream warm colors, but they are subtly and effectively throughout.  Excellent.', '2008-04-07 23:11:45.000000', NULL, 1),
