(4622316, 665141, 90806, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  I like how the background has a similar color tone but is just enough different to provide contrast to the edges.</td>', 'Beautiful.  I like how the background has a similar color tone but is just enough different to provide contrast to the edges.', '2008-04-07 23:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
