(4622342, 663989, 90806, '<td valign="top">Pretty.  Too bad the tree tops weren''t on the bottom left for symmetry with the cloud angle.</td>', 'Pretty.  Too bad the tree tops weren''t on the bottom left for symmetry with the cloud angle.', '2008-04-07 23:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
