(4622361, 664529, 90806, '<td valign="top">Love the petal shadows.  Wish the flower 1/3 up from the bottom and 1/3 in from the right was in focus, it grabs my attention.</td>', 'Love the petal shadows.  Wish the flower 1/3 up from the bottom and 1/3 in from the right was in focus, it grabs my attention.', '2008-04-07 23:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4622362, 664978, 83313, '<td valign="top">A lot of visible artifacts in the background. Some noise reduction would have helped make it a bit smoother. Also some JPEG compression is taking away detail. Your file is half the size that was allowed. Check your compression settings in your image editor, and always save as close as possible to the Kb limit for the challenge..</td>', 'A lot of visible artifacts in the background. Some noise reduction would have helped make it a bit smoother. Also some JPEG compression is taking away detail. Your file is half the size that was allowed. Check your compression settings in your image editor, and always save as close as possible to the Kb limit for the challenge..', '2008-04-07 23:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4622363, 664488, 90806, '<td valign="top">Nicely framed with great clarity on the flower.  I really like it how it is but part of me would like to see the nice textures and vein pattern in the yellow sepal a bit more clearly just because they look like they are really great.</td>', 'Nicely framed with great clarity on the flower.  I really like it how it is but part of me would like to see the nice textures and vein pattern in the yellow sepal a bit more clearly just because they look like they are really great.', '2008-04-07 23:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
