(4622370, 665137, 90806, '<td valign="top">Nice warm browns with a hint of orange.  Soon to be green leaves with a hint of spring.  Seems to be a bit of a halo along the lower edge of the bud and twig and less so but somewhat there on the upper edge.</td>', 'Nice warm browns with a hint of orange.  Soon to be green leaves with a hint of spring.  Seems to be a bit of a halo along the lower edge of the bud and twig and less so but somewhat there on the upper edge.', '2008-04-07 23:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
