(4622519, 664677, 83313, '<td valign="top">Must be a stock pond. <br/> <br/>Focus is a little off. Hard to get focus right through the water, I''ve been working on improving my aquarium shots as well, and this is better than anything I have gotten.</td>', 'Must be a stock pond.  Focus is a little off. Hard to get focus right through the water, I''ve been working on improving my aquarium shots as well, and this is better than anything I have gotten.', '2008-04-08 00:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4622547, 664666, 83313, '<td valign="top">Your file size is only 54k when you could have used up to 150k. This indicates a lot of JPEG compression, which is taking a lot of detail and clarity out of your photo. Check the JPEG compression settings in your image editor and always try to save as close to the limit for a challenge as you can get it without going over.</td>', 'Your file size is only 54k when you could have used up to 150k. This indicates a lot of JPEG compression, which is taking a lot of detail and clarity out of your photo. Check the JPEG compression settings in your image editor and always try to save as close to the limit for a challenge as you can get it without going over.', '2008-04-08 00:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
