(4623825, 663627, 78196, '<td valign="top">This looks like it''s suffering from a very nasty jpeg conversion - jaggies everywhere and strange grey halos in high contrast areas. I wonder what software you''re using? Also, coloured borders, though suitably chosen here, don''t go down very well at DPC. But a fun shot nevertheless that would benefit from better processing.</td>', 'This looks like it''s suffering from a very nasty jpeg conversion - jaggies everywhere and strange grey halos in high contrast areas. I wonder what software you''re using? Also, coloured borders, though suitably chosen here, don''t go down very well at DPC. But a fun shot nevertheless that would benefit from better processing.', '2008-04-08 12:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4623827, 664806, 78196, '<td valign="top">Oh this is fabulous. Great lighting, textures and colours and masterful control of DoF.</td>', 'Oh this is fabulous. Great lighting, textures and colours and masterful control of DoF.', '2008-04-08 12:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4623832, 664522, 79563, '<td valign="top">original!   I like the concept!</td>', 'original!   I like the concept!', '2008-04-08 12:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
