(4623838, 664412, 78196, '<td valign="top">Amazing. Is that gravy or curry sauce? As an Englishman this is something I can truly appreciate, though obviously as it''s not very pretty I imagine you''re getting slaughtered something awful. Kudos for entering the shot!</td>', 'Amazing. Is that gravy or curry sauce? As an Englishman this is something I can truly appreciate, though obviously as it''s not very pretty I imagine you''re getting slaughtered something awful. Kudos for entering the shot!', '2008-04-08 12:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
