(4623848, 662552, 78196, '<td valign="top">This is either a bad jpeg conversion, over-sharpened or both. The pixellated areas around the trees are the giveaway and it does rather spoil the image. The composition is fine and the sunset very nice although a crop which removed the roofs would detract from the ''taken out of the bedroom window'' feel which I imagine is resulting in a low score.</td>', 'This is either a bad jpeg conversion, over-sharpened or both. The pixellated areas around the trees are the giveaway and it does rather spoil the image. The composition is fine and the sunset very nice although a crop which removed the roofs would detract from the ''taken out of the bedroom window'' feel which I imagine is resulting in a low score.', '2008-04-08 12:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4623851, 664770, 78196, '<td valign="top">Well handled, and I like the centred composition.</td>', 'Well handled, and I like the centred composition.', '2008-04-08 12:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4623857, 662549, 78196, '<td valign="top">A bit of a stretch for the challenge but who am I to judge (currently getting slaughtered in the Cool Colors challenge for that very reason) - very sharp, well exposed and the toast looks done to perfection. You''ve gone and made me hungry now...</td>', 'A bit of a stretch for the challenge but who am I to judge (currently getting slaughtered in the Cool Colors challenge for that very reason) - very sharp, well exposed and the toast looks done to perfection. You''ve gone and made me hungry now...', '2008-04-08 12:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4623868, 664899, 78196, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract. A bit of a stretch for the challenge title however.</td>', 'Nice abstract. A bit of a stretch for the challenge title however.', '2008-04-08 12:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4623872, 662568, 78196, '<td valign="top">A very well done layed composition. Would have possibly liked even more of the black cloud at top.</td>', 'A very well done layed composition. Would have possibly liked even more of the black cloud at top.', '2008-04-08 12:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4623877, 665055, 78196, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous. This has an evocative, almost dreamlike quality.</td>', 'Gorgeous. This has an evocative, almost dreamlike quality.', '2008-04-08 12:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4623888, 663094, 78196, '<td valign="top">Magnificent. Great and unusual framing - I assume this is HDR, it''s very well done indeed. Fantastic treatment of colour, and the birds are the icing on the cake. Bravo.</td>', 'Magnificent. Great and unusual framing - I assume this is HDR, it''s very well done indeed. Fantastic treatment of colour, and the birds are the icing on the cake. Bravo.', '2008-04-08 12:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4623894, 664799, 78196, '<td valign="top">Thank you for adding some interest to this challenge. And it''s a very well taken and processed shot.</td>', 'Thank you for adding some interest to this challenge. And it''s a very well taken and processed shot.', '2008-04-08 13:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4623903, 662545, 78196, '<td valign="top">I''m not quite sure how you managed to achieve this within basic editing parameters but the effect is quite stunning - the reflections in particular are wonderful. The lack of pin-sharpness actually helps, there''s a dizzying, almost hypnotic feel to the image.</td>', 'I''m not quite sure how you managed to achieve this within basic editing parameters but the effect is quite stunning - the reflections in particular are wonderful. The lack of pin-sharpness actually helps, there''s a dizzying, almost hypnotic feel to the image.', '2008-04-08 13:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4623910, 663425, 78196, '<td valign="top">It looks like you''ve gone a bit crazy on the USM and perhaps shadow/highlight - there''s all sorts of haloing around the subject. That said, the sharpness in admirable and the centered composition is beautiful.</td>', 'It looks like you''ve gone a bit crazy on the USM and perhaps shadow/highlight - there''s all sorts of haloing around the subject. That said, the sharpness in admirable and the centered composition is beautiful.', '2008-04-08 13:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4623912, 664586, 78196, '<td valign="top">Fantastic control of exposure and a refreshing attitude towards sharpness. Beautiful image.</td>', 'Fantastic control of exposure and a refreshing attitude towards sharpness. Beautiful image.', '2008-04-08 13:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4623916, 664396, 78196, '<td valign="top">An extra couple of points for making me laugh. Entries like this should be essential in challenges!</td>', 'An extra couple of points for making me laugh. Entries like this should be essential in challenges!', '2008-04-08 13:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4623918, 662606, 78196, '<td valign="top">Wow. I don''t know why you didn''t make this bigger as the incredible variety of light and texture is quite astonishing here. You''ve even got some birds into the mix as well. Awesome work.</td>', 'Wow. I don''t know why you didn''t make this bigger as the incredible variety of light and texture is quite astonishing here. You''ve even got some birds into the mix as well. Awesome work.', '2008-04-08 13:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4623920, 663195, 34255, '<td valign="top">I like this image, it fits the challenge well.  I might like it better with less negative space.</td>', 'I like this image, it fits the challenge well.  I might like it better with less negative space.', '2008-04-08 13:15:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4624056, 663181, 85799, '<td valign="top">Hey, finally one that truly fits the challenge!</td>', 'Hey, finally one that truly fits the challenge!', '2008-04-08 14:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4624118, 663952, 90658, '<td valign="top">This could go either way...warm or cool.  Big limb to go out on, as it''s mostly cool, but I appreciate what you''ve done here.</td>', 'This could go either way...warm or cool.  Big limb to go out on, as it''s mostly cool, but I appreciate what you''ve done here.', '2008-04-08 15:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4624131, 664020, 90658, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, but waaaaaay out on the warm limb.  This is 90% cool, but I won''t go so far as to say dnmc, as yellow and orange do qualify as warm colors.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, but waaaaaay out on the warm limb.  This is 90% cool, but I won''t go so far as to say dnmc, as yellow and orange do qualify as warm colors.', '2008-04-08 15:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4624882, 662368, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice bold colors that pop in this one. Unfortunately, it''s the classic 5 for me. For some reason I can''t quite nail down, it is not having a huge amount of appeal to me, but it''s not a bad shot either. There are some modest jaggies visible around the edge of the car. A different resizing method may have helped there. Perhaps it is that the umbrella and car hood are both partially cut off at the edge of the frame. I do like the story that is told by this shot.</td>', 'Nice bold colors that pop in this one. Unfortunately, it''s the classic 5 for me. For some reason I can''t quite nail down, it is not having a huge amount of appeal to me, but it''s not a bad shot either. There are some modest jaggies visible around the edge of the car. A different resizing method may have helped there. Perhaps it is that the umbrella and car hood are both partially cut off at the edge of the frame. I do like the story that is told by this shot.', '2008-04-08 22:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4624919, 664198, 87808, '<td valign="top">this is an amazing capture, how did you manage to get so close to your subject. Maybe just a tad bit more saturation to bring out those warm tones of the brown would be in order, but you have certainly got a good contender here for a high score.  The catch light in his eyes is wonderful, showing hte trees and not yourself, the anticipation of his little hands coming up to his mouth and wondering if there is something yummy in his little hands is priceless. Wonderful capture, I am jealous!  Well Done</td>', 'this is an amazing capture, how did you manage to get so close to your subject. Maybe just a tad bit more saturation to bring out those warm tones of the brown would be in order, but you have certainly got a good contender here for a high score.  The catch light in his eyes is wonderful, showing hte trees and not yourself, the anticipation of his little hands coming up to his mouth and wondering if there is something yummy in his little hands is priceless. Wonderful capture, I am jealous!  Well Done', '2008-04-08 23:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4624921, 662549, 87808, '<td valign="top">Humour is fabulous here, I though tthis was brilliant.  The colours are so crisp and your lines on teh toast are very clean, Well done</td>', 'Humour is fabulous here, I though tthis was brilliant.  The colours are so crisp and your lines on teh toast are very clean, Well done', '2008-04-08 23:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
