(4626315, 664799, 61012, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot Cindi! The fire looks like it has a life of its own.<br/> <br/>I''ve been waiting to confirm if this was yours all week. I knew from the "show me your scores" thread that you were close to a 7. All day yesterday my score changed from 6.9XX to 7.0XX with every vote so I knew our scores must be close. I fully expected you to stil be above me in the end.</td>', 'Excellent shot Cindi! The fire looks like it has a life of its own. I''ve been waiting to confirm if this was yours all week. I knew from the "show me your scores" thread that you were close to a 7. All day yesterday my score changed from 6.9XX to 7.0XX with every vote so I knew our scores must be close. I fully expected you to stil be above me in the end.', '2008-04-09 09:35:49.000000', NULL, 0),
