(4626337, 663701, 51269, '<td valign="top">Well, ya beat me, Randy....whine, whine. What about taking into consideration the over-all quality of the image &amp; NOT just how "warm" it is ???? No siree, not on DPC :)</td>', 'Well, ya beat me, Randy....whine, whine. What about taking into consideration the over-all quality of the image & NOT just how "warm" it is ???? No siree, not on DPC :)', '2008-04-09 09:42:11.000000', NULL, 0),
