(4690833, 663684, 62357, '<td valign="top">Although this met the challenge in a sense it is a warm colour, I do not find it to be a particularly interesting shot.  It is not sufficient to meet the challenge, you need to shoot a subject that draws the voter in.  This does not do that.</td>', 'Although this met the challenge in a sense it is a warm colour, I do not find it to be a particularly interesting shot.  It is not sufficient to meet the challenge, you need to shoot a subject that draws the voter in.  This does not do that.', '2008-05-08 17:48:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(4692822, 663465, 41206, '<td valign="top">Wow! After 61 (sixty one) entries I am very pleased to receive an award here! Thanks! Actually the photo <b>was</b> a ''grab'' shot taken while being paid to photograph a high school prom. I looked out the window to check on the weather and noticed this scene. I spent about 15 seconds taking maybe 3 versions of this scene. Some people thought it was quite amatuerish, but well executed none-the-less. Sometimes the simple photos reveal the sublime! Not much I would have done differently had I taken more time: perhaps not shot this at 1600 ISO, perhaps I would have used a tripod, or maybe even created it as a raw image...<br/>Thanks again, I await the results of every entry I submit, and I will never give up!</td>', 'Wow! After 61 (sixty one) entries I am very pleased to receive an award here! Thanks! Actually the photo was a ''grab'' shot taken while being paid to photograph a high school prom. I looked out the window to check on the weather and noticed this scene. I spent about 15 seconds taking maybe 3 versions of this scene. Some people thought it was quite amatuerish, but well executed none-the-less. Sometimes the simple photos reveal the sublime! Not much I would have done differently had I taken more time: perhaps not shot this at 1600 ISO, perhaps I would have used a tripod, or maybe even created it as a raw image...Thanks again, I await the results of every entry I submit, and I will never give up!', '2008-05-09 15:58:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(4714208, 662542, 48228, '<td valign="top">Maybe a little soft, which I don''t mind, but I like to see this with a stronger focus. <br/> <br/>Also take a lot of different compositions next time, from all angles, as I feel in this one I am looking everywhere foe a focus point with this image.<br/> <br/>I hope this helps, but again enjoy what you do, and keeping on taking photographs, as this is one way or improving your skills.</td>', 'Maybe a little soft, which I don''t mind, but I like to see this with a stronger focus.  Also take a lot of different compositions next time, from all angles, as I feel in this one I am looking everywhere foe a focus point with this image. I hope this helps, but again enjoy what you do, and keeping on taking photographs, as this is one way or improving your skills.', '2008-05-21 05:31:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4726607, 664400, 45475, '<td valign="top">How ironic =/<br/> <br/>Funny concept that would have benefited from some good lighting. The bright spots of glare on the dispensers aren''t helping and neither is that distracting background.</td>', 'How ironic =/ Funny concept that would have benefited from some good lighting. The bright spots of glare on the dispensers aren''t helping and neither is that distracting background.', '2008-05-27 00:37:31.000000', NULL, 0),
